{"parent_asin": "B07NY2HYLN", "title": "BN3TH Men's Pro Ionic Plus No Stink Boxer Briefs - Breathable Underwear with MyPakage Pouch", "features": ["85% Polyester / 7% XT2Polyester/ 8% Spandex", "Imported", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash Cold, Tumble Dry Low or Hang Dry if You're Feeling Fancy", "NO STINK - ALL DAY, EVERY DAY - Men's underwear with builtin Pro Ionic+ NO STINK Technology to kill odor before it starts, keeping you comfortable and fresh throughout the day", "MY PACKAGE POUCH - Our patented MyPakage Technology made to lift & separate your boys, eliminating the need to shift or adjust throughout the day", "ELEVATED COMFORT - Breathable, moisture-wicking, slim fit no fly underwear made to contour to your body with our signature seamless pucker panel and a soft luxury knitted waistband; shorts length 6.5\" inseam", "INCREASED COMFORT = INCREASED PERFORMANCE - We engineer underwear and base layers that keep you comfortable for full days on the mountain, on the water, in the gym, or in the office", "RADICALLY BETTER UNDERWEAR - We were the first to create underwear with a three-dimensional pouch, and our patented MyPakage Pouch Technology remains the key to our uniquely supportive fit"], "description": [], "price": 34.95, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Underwear", "Boxer Briefs"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "3 x 8 x 5 inches; 3.2 Ounces", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "February 21, 2019", "Manufacturer": "BN3TH"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 84, "store": "BN3TH"}
