{"parent_asin": "B07F2XGDP5", "title": "Zexxxy Women's Zipper Robes Half Sleeve Zip Front Robe Knee Length Lightweight Housecoats with Pockets S-2XL", "features": ["Polyester", "Zipper closure", "ZIP ROBES FABRIC: The material of these womens sleepwear zipperred robes varies depending on the styles.(Solid color zip robe: polyester, cotton and spandex. Floral zip up robe: polyester & spandex. Striped robe: cotton & spandex.) The fabrics are so lightweight, breathable and comfortable that these robes can be worn in warm weather, even for summer without pressures", "SECURE: Robe with zipper. The zipper front design of the bathrobes offers great convenience for your robe to stay securely closed and keep private. If you would like just a cover-up robe before or after swimming, bathing and sleeping, these robes are easy to get in or take off", "LOUNGEWEAR ROBE WITH POCKETS: Multifunction side pockets provides easy use in wearing whether you are staying home or going out, convenient for you to keep small items like your phone, keys and cards, etc", "OCCASIONS: Suits for Parties ,home wear and sleepwear and every casual time. It's comfortable to wear as a zip robe, zipper bathrobe, floral cover-up and cardigan. The zip-up robes are also suitable for lounging or going out to walk your dogs, taking a stroll or running errands", "Tips: If you have any questions with these zip robe, pls let us know by emails, and we will provide resolutions to you within 24 hrs"], "description": [], "price": 31.59, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Lingerie, Sleep & Lounge", "Sleep & Lounge", "Robes"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "9.84 x 7.87 x 1.97 inches; 7.05 Ounces", "Item model number": "ZE0197-US-Color", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "June 27, 2018"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 2619, "store": "Zexxxy"}
