{"parent_asin": "B09YTZ1H4D", "title": "USHTH Black Waterproof Rain Boot Shoe Cover with reflector (1 Pair) (Medium)", "features": ["♦[USHTH / LOSHTH Quality PVC Fabric: All Angle Protections] - 100% high elastic PVC materials. 100% Solid Water, Oil, Dustproof & Anti-skid compatibilities.", "♦[Portable Foldable and Reusable] - Every pair of shoe cover comes with a waterproof package bag, you can easily put them in your bag after use.", "♦[Unique design] - 1. Safety reflector on heel; 2. Comprehensive waterproof zipper.", "♦[Fashion and Adjustable Design] - Fashionable sport style; Wide mouth design, easy to put on and off; Good elasticity of the surrounding on the top, convenient to adjust to the degree of tightness.", "♦[Wide Applications] - You can wear rain snow shoe covers to do Cleaning Washing Cycling Motorcycle Traveling Camping Hiking Fishing Hunting Shooting Farming Painting etc.✮✮✮FREE exchange size and 100% money-back guarantee if you are not satisfied✮✮✮ If you have any question on this waterproof shoe cover, feel free to contact us via email and you will be updated in 24 hours."], "description": ["USHTH / LOSHTH Highlights of the Shoes Cover", "★1. Plastic strap snaps over your foot for a snug fit.  ★2. Super easy to slip on with a full-length side zipper.  ★3. Safety reflector on the heel.  ★4. Tightly fit with elastic surrounding on the top.  ★5. Made of high-quality waterproof PVC material keeping dry and clean for your expensive shoes and boots, extending the lifetime of your footwear.  ★6. Not only perfect for cycling, Motorcycle, traveling, hiking, walking; but also use for daily life, wear it doing cleaning work at home. put on it to School, Office, Garden, Park, Farm, Beach on a rainy day.  ★7. Nonslip Rubber Bottom to ensure your safety; New generation touched soft and super comfortable wear feel; Reusable, anti-skidding; fordable and portable; Easy to clean;", "NOTE: There are five different sizes for optional, please measure your actual sole 