{"parent_asin": "B075VLHTV4", "title": "Soojun Women's Waffle Fleece Soft Zip Up Front Bathrobe", "features": ["100% Polyester", "Zipper closure", "Machine Wash", "Get the perfect zip up robes for women in the length you desire! Measuring between 48\" (for the S-M size) and 54\" (for the XL-XXL) in length, The zip up robe are designed to be full length for complete coverage and ultimate comfort. Model in the photo is 5'6\", 120 lbs, and is wearing a size Medium-Large", "Cozy - Womens robes are soft and fluffy, These robes for women will keep you warm as you relax at home. Bathrobe for women zipper front provides the perfect amount of warmth without weighing you down", "Convenient Pockets - Our zip up bathrobes for women provide two slip front pockets, Perfect for storing all your stuff with convenience, or just for keeping your hands warm in this womens robes long zipper front. It's the best place to keep your phone, earplugs, sleep mask and so much more", "Sizing & Care Instructions - See size chart for details. Our bath robes female are machine washable, but we highly recommend your new luxury robe be hand washed and laid flat to dry before wearing. please size up if in-between sizes", "Ideal As a Gift - These zipper robes for women is a perfect gift for your mother, wife, girl friend, daughter. or simply as a treat for yourself! These plush robes are unisex which means you can buy two bathrobe as a couples gift for your loved one's wedding or anniversary"], "description": [], "price": 33.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Lingerie, Sleep & Lounge", "Sleep & Lounge", "Robes"], "details": {"Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "September 22, 2017"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 2934, "store": "Soojun"}
{"parent_asin": "B073VZPXHS", "title": "ISAACSONG.DESIGN Sterling Silver Cat Kitty Jewelry Set - Cat Lovers Necklace, Earrings, Bracelet, Ring Set for Women", "features": ["HIGH MATERIALS: Three times 14K white gold-plated, environmental friendly material, Nickle-free, Lead-free and hypoallergenic. Protect your skin no harm to health. Not easy to tarnish. Advanced hand polished, make the metal color bright and durable, comfortable to wear daily.", "JEWELRY SPECIFICATION: Chose the thick clasp which lasts longer. Necklace chain size: 15” and 2” inches adjustable chain. Cute lucky sweet cat kitty charm size: 2.8 cm. 1 pc Necklace and 1 pair earring in each set. Tiny eyes on kitty’s face. And lucky cat’s body swings a bit. Brilliant and eye-catching design, suit for any season, outfit and occasion.", "JEWELRY HIGHLIGHT: Inspired by cute and mysterious cats. Like a naughty cat stretching and lying on your collarbone and ear, “meow, meow” whispering how much he/she loves you. The earrings have different ways to wear as your choice, please check the instruction picture. A statement and unique jewelry set delivers a flawless fit for girls or women. Especially for the cat lovers.", "GIFT CHOICE & RECOMMEND: Perfect presents for women, girls, teen, kids and sharing with your best friends. A great gift for Valentine’s day, Thanksgiving, Mother’s Day, Anniversary, Birthday, Christmas, Graduation, New Year. Gift this precious piece to someone who inspires you or yourself. An elegant, inspirational and brilliant expression of your fair maiden beauty.", "PACKAGE & SERVICE: Each order delivered with ISAACSONG.DESIGN gift jewelry box and jewelry bag. It is perfect for instant gift-giving. Your happy is our happy, we are here to help if you have any question with your order. Buy absolutely no risk."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Jewelry Sets"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "4.33 x 3.7 x 1.02 inches; 1.09 Ounces", "Item model number": "925 Silver Set 1", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "July 11, 2017", "Manufacturer": "ISAACSONG, INC."}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 492, "store": "ISAACSONG.DESIGN"}
{"parent_asin": "B019EZ1TG0", "title": "Black Diamond Equipment Midweight Softshell Gloves - Smoke - Large", "features": ["Fleece,Leather,Neoprene", "Four-way stretch softshell fabric with DWR treatment", "Digital thumb and index finger allow for gloves-on touchscreen use", "Full goat leather palm", "60 g PrimaLoft Gold Insulation on back of hand", "Neoprene and fleece cuff", "Reflective logo"], "description": ["Built with durable, stretchy and weather-resistant softshell fabric for high-output pursuits in mild conditions, the Black Diamond MidWeight Softshell gloves offer dynamic, breathable protection while ski touring, climbing or backpacking. The full goat leather palms and fingers offer a secure grip on poles or tools and feature digital material on the thumbs and index fingers allow for gloves-on touchscreen functionality. Comfortable, fleece-lined neoprene cuffs seal out the elements and make for easy on and off."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Specific Clothing", "Skiing", "Men", "Gloves"], "details": {"Brand": "BLACK DIAMOND", "Material": "Neoprene, Leather", "Age Range (Description)": "Adult", "Color": "Smoke", "Special Feature": "Reflective, Thermal, Touch Screen Support", "Hand Orientation": "Ambidextrous", "Item Package Quantity": "1", "Product Care Instructions": "Hand Wash", "Item Weight": "68 Grams", "Closure Type": "Pull On", "Style": "Cuff,Protection,Reflective", "Item Package Dimensions L x W x H": "13.23 x 5.91 x 1.81 inches", "Package Weight": "0.14 Kilograms", "Item Dimensions  LxWxH": "14 x 6 x 2 inches", "Brand Name": "BLACK DIAMOND", "Model Name": "Midweight Softshell Gloves", "Suggested Users": "Unisex-adult, Mens", "Manufacturer": "Black Diamond Equipment", "Part Number": "801041", "Model Year": "2017", "Outer Material": "Leather,Neoprene", "Best Sellers Rank": {"Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry": 3701131, "Women's Skiing & Snowboarding Gloves": 701, "Men's Skiing & Snowboarding Gloves": 995}, "Date First Available": "August 20, 2009"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 33, "store": "BLACK DIAMOND"}
