{"parent_asin": "B016I7IV2W", "title": "Amazon Brand - Lark & Ro Women's High-Low Hem Printed Shift Dress", "features": ["100% Polyester", "Imported", "Machine Wash", "Lark & Ro crafts a classic T-shirt dress with a dramatic high/low hem and slit side seams.", "Exposed back zipper, short sleeves, crew neckline", "Model is 5' 10\" and wearing a size Small", "Dress length measures 37\" from top of the shoulder to bottom hem"], "description": ["An Amazon brand - Lark & Ro crafts a classic T-shirt dress with a dramatic high/low hem and slit side seams.", "Lark & Ro empowers women to be their best selves in figure-loving fits and desk-to-dinner versatility. Our collection of women’s dresses, blouses, dress shirts, sweaters, and more marries soft fabrics with chic designs for easily paired pieces that take care of business."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Dresses", "Casual"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "11.9 x 7.3 x 1.9 inches; 7.2 Ounces", "Item model number": "D-1002P1", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "February 6, 2016", "Manufacturer": "Lark & Ro"}, "average_rating": 3.0, "rating_number": 7, "store": "Lark & Ro"}
{"parent_asin": "B07S75ZJZR", "title": "LHSPOSIFD Unisex Mens Baseball Hat Casual Adjustable Mesh Sports-MTU-Friedrichshafen-Flat Cap", "features": ["Cotton,Mesh", "Buckle closure", "100% Cotton. Its texture is soft, feels good, and the hat made is particularly comfortable to wear.", "Stylish design, Nice stitching, High quality material and manufacturing process. 7-14 days fast delivery.", "Great for all seasons and provides shade while running quick errands, marathons, enjoying outdoor activities.", "Adjustable buckle closure: Size Fits Most, Comfortable Everyday Fit. Use the convenient closure to custom fit the baseball cap to your head and ensure maximum comfort and a secure fit at all times.", "The unisex design makes it suitably perfect for both men and women. We also have sleeve Beach Shorts yoga sports bra legging pants Table Mats hair brush comb Leg Compression Calf baby bodysuits onesies Slippers & Sandals knit beanies Panties mug flag Clear transparent drawstring back bag mask pillow cover Door Mat Towel packsack phone case cover for apple 6 6s plus 7 8 plus x xs max xr T shirt tee hoodies sweatshirt coat jacket shoes sneakers cap hat with the same theme and pattern in our amazo"], "description": ["Our baseball cap are perfect for bad hair days ,also suitable for casual daily wear ,you can wear it as a trucker hat to go for camping ,fishing ,traveling ,cycling,jogging ,always keep you cool and attractive."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "5.91 x 3.94 x 1.97 inches", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "May 23, 2019"}, "average_rating": 1.8, "rating_number": 4, "store": "LHSPOSIFD"}
{"parent_asin": "B00KTM27TQ", "title": "Tissot Men's T0954491706700 Quickster Analog Display Swiss Quartz White Watch", "features": ["Tissot quickster soccer world cup black dial white silicone men's watch", "Luminescent hands and markers. Date display at the 4 o'clock position. Chronograph - three sub-dials displaying: 60 second, 60 minute and soccer period", "Swiss-quartz movement", "Case diameter: 42mm", "Water resistant to 330 feet"], "description": ["For more than 150 years, Tissot has embodied the innovation and tradition of Swiss watch-making. Based in the Neuchâtel area of the Jura Mountains, in Le Locle, Switzerland, Charles-Félicien Tissot and his son Charles-Emile created the watch making company Tissot in 1853. Whether in the technology of its movements, in the research for special materials or in the very functions of the watch itself, Tissot's engineers and watchmakers have developed pioneering timepieces over the years.", "Some of Tissot's triumphs over the years include the the Idea 2001 (the world's first plastic watch) released in 1971, the Rock watch (which set the timepiece's movement in a stone case made from Swiss Alps granite) in 1985, and the Wood watch from 1988 (with a completely wooden case). Tissot uses the best movements (from ETA SA Manufacture Horlogère Suisse), the highest quality materials (316L steel, 18K gold, titanium) and scratch-proof glasses (sapphire crystal--at least 2500 Vickers).", "The company has been involved with high profile sports events since 1974 when they sponsored a racing car in the 24 Hours of Le Mans, France. Since then Tissot's timepieces have been chosen as official timekeepers for world championships in cycling, motorcycling, fencing and ice hockey. And Tissot is currently the the official watch and timekeeper of NASCAR.", "Tissot timepieces have been worn by a bevy of celebrities over the years--including Grace Kelly, Elvis Presley and Nelson Mandela--and James Stewart's character L.B. Jefferies wore a Tissot timepiece in Alfred Hitchcock's \"Rear Window.\" Today the company is represented in a variety of sporting fields by English soccer star Michael Owen, IndyCar driver Danica Patrick, and MotoGP world champion Nicky Hayden. Today, Tissot is a member of the Swatch Group, the world's largest watch producer and distributor.", "Stainless steel case with a white silicone strap. Stainless steel bezel with grey top ring. Black dial with luminous silver-tone hands and index hour markers. Arabic numeral marks the 12 o'clock position. Minute markers around the outer rim."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "3.39 x 6.69 x 4.72 inches; 15.84 Ounces", "Item model number": "T0954491706700", "Department": "mens", "Batteries": "1 CR2 batteries required. (included)", "Date First Available": "June 6, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Tissot"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 48, "store": "Tissot"}
