{"parent_asin": "B07MZ942LH", "title": "GHYUGR Short Sleeve Polo Shirts for Men Basic Cotton Contrasting Colors Threaded T-Shirt Casual Polos Tops", "features": ["Pull On closure", "Hang to dry", "Please refer to our size chart in pictures before ordering, and maybe you need to choose one size bigger than your rugular size!", "Features: An all-time fashion classic contrasting color collor with 3 button closure, thread fabric, Simple and fashionable", "Material: breathable material, extremely comfortable and soft.", "Our polo shirt is suitable for casual sport, business work, party, nights out, evenings, and other important occasions. Perfect gift for families, friends and boyfriend.", "Garment Care: Machine wash cold, Hang to dry, Warm iron if needed"], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Shirts", "Polos"], "details": {"Brand": "GHYUGR", "Color": "Light Grey", "Fit Type": "Classic Fit", "Style": "Classic", "Neck Style": "Henley Neck", "Material": "Cotton", "Sleeve Type": "Short Sleeve", "Shirt form type": "T-Shirt", "Collar Style": "Button Down Collar", "Item Length (Description)": "Standard Length", "Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "10.47 x 7.56 x 1.49 inches; 11.29 Ounces", "Item model number": "shenkaclothing0241-seller", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "February 18, 2019"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 2522, "store": "GHYUGR"}
{"parent_asin": "B09P8JTT4S", "title": "FITRELL 6 Pack Men's Athletic Crew Socks Cushioned Work Boot Socks Size 9-12/12-15", "features": ["Made of Premium Polyster Fabric, Nylon, Rubber, Spandex.", "Size L-Men's shoe size 9-12, Size XL-Men's shoe size 12-15.", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "【SIZE】: L-Men's shoe size 9-12, XL-Men's show size 12-15", "[Comfortable] The thick full cushioned footbed in these men's crew socks makes them soft and comfortable. Additionally, they are anti-blisters when walking, exercising, performing heavy duty work, hiking, running, and other activities", "[Durable] These men's work socks are reinforced at the heel and toe with tough towel materials so that they maintain their shape and comfort through multiple washings. The large size can be worn by any man with shoe size from 9-12 and extra large for shoe size between 12-15", "[Non-Slip Design] Stretchable elastic band is included on the top of the athletic socks. It can provide light compression and keep socks in place throughout a full day of work or exercise", "[Moisture Control] Our men's crew socks are made with moisture-wicking materials that keep your feet dry and comfortable when you wear steel-toed boots, hiking boots, or other sneakers", "[After Sales Service] If these men's crew socks don't fit right or aren't good quality, please feel free to contact us"], "description": [], "price": 20.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Athletic Socks"], "details": {"Department": "unisex-adult", "Date First Available": "December 27, 2021"}, "average_rating": 4.4, "rating_number": 426, "store": "FITRELL"}
