{"parent_asin": "B013KD0MAQ", "title": "Silver Finish St. Raphael the Archangel Rosary with 6mm Zircon Color Fire Polished Beads, St. Raphael the Archangel Center, and 1 3/8 x 3/4 inch Crucifix, Gift Boxed", "features": ["St. Raphael the Archangel Center and 1 3/8 x 3/4 Inch Crucifix", "Rhodium Finish Links and 6mm Zircon Color Fire Polished Beads (December Birthstone)", "Custom Made in the USA by Skilled Artisans", "Lifetime Guarantee Against Tarnishing and Breakage", "Packaged in a Felted Metal, Hinged, Gift Box"], "description": ["Let Raphael the Archangel be your saintly companion in prayer with this beautiful patron saint rosary. This custom St. Raphael the Archangel rosary is handmade for you by a talented artisan at the time of your order. Made in the US, this beautiful, high quality rosary comes with a lifetime guarantee against tarnishing and breakage. In the Catholic tradition, the rosary is a form of prayer consisting of repeating a set of prayers, while reflecting on a mystery of faith. Each set consists of the Our Father prayed once, followed by Hail Mary prayed ten times, and ending with the Glory Be prayed once. A typical rosary has five decades (repetitions of the set prayers). There are also special opening and closing prayers."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Necklaces", "Y-Necklaces"], "details": {"Item model number": "Catholic Saint Medals", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "August 7, 2015", "Manufacturer": "Bliss"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 1, "store": "Catholic Saint Medals"}
