{"parent_asin": "B07GMTM566", "title": "Thread Ball Dangle Earrings Beaded Lantern Ear Stud Drop Wrapped Triple Balls Fashion Tassel Earring for Women -Gold", "features": ["【FASHION DESIGN】: 3 gold balls drop earrings, a jewellery full of grace that can easily be worn thoughout the day.", "【WEAR IT EVERYDAY】: Dainty unique and pretty earrings that can be worn everyday. You can wear it to attend any special occasions, like friends dinner party, festival celebration, sweetheart's graduation, prom, concert, anniversary, dancing ball, baby shower, engagement wedding, birthday party, christmas carnival, halloween parade, business talks, formal events. It is helpful in a perfect image for a date with your boyfriend, husband and lover, fit for any ages.", "【UNIQUE DESIGN WITH PERSONAL STYLE】:They are crafted with golden plated wire, it is simple and understated but gorgeous and classy, they are a completely different style than your another studs earrings."], "description": ["This is a pair of beautiful thread lantern ball hoops pierced earrings. They are crafted with golden plated wire, fashion pattern minimalist simplified geometric design. The sparkling appearance can show your charm, catching everyone's eyes in the crowd.", "Specification", "Color:Gold Material: eco alloy and acrylic beads Size: L 3.54 inch(9cm) Weight：0.63 oz（18g) each pair. Package: 1 pair Triple Ball Earring Dangle This pretty earrings go with everything in your closet, from your day-to-day office attire, to your evening wear, from your casual workout clothes, to jeans and a T-shirt! Good match with dress, vest, shirt, jacket, and so on, no matter what you want, just enjoy this moment."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Earrings", "Drop & Dangle"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "5.6 x 3.5 x 0.9 inches; 0.81 Ounces", "Item model number": "TMS5", "Department": "womens", "Manufacturer": "Tansorm"}, "average_rat