{"parent_asin": "B075VJ416K", "title": "Superman Costume Logo Men's Underwear Briefs", "features": ["95% Cotton, and 5% Spandex", "Machine Wash", "Officially licensed DC Comics merchandise", "Superman logo and costume designed men's briefs", "Sizes: Small (28-30), Medium (32-34), Large (36-38), X-Large (40-42), 2X-Large (44-46), 3X-Large (48-50)", "Soft, comfortable and breathable material", "Detailed and vibrant design"], "description": ["Fashionable enough to wear on the outside. Superman shattered fashion paradigms by wearing underwear OVER his very tight leggings. At first, this seemed like utter alien buffoonery, but the trend caught on after Superman committed super-deeds with boldly-worn outer-underwear. Made from 95% cotton and 5% spandex, our EXCLUSIVE Superman Symbol Men's Underwear Fashion Briefs convey Superman's red, yellow, and blue costume aesthetic with the following intricately stitched and boldly symbolic accents: An elastic waistband with yellow, embroidered Superman symbols, A front and center screen-printed Superman symbol, Red, stitched seams, accents and borders, and a fully functional fly!"], "price": 19.96, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Men", "Underwear", "Briefs"], "details": {"Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "September 22, 2017"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 102, "store": "SuperHeroStuff"}
