{"parent_asin": "B00KVU0M3E", "title": "Tommie Copper Recovery V Neck Compression Shirt for Women, Breathable Base Layer for Everyday Support, Black, Small", "features": ["Copper Polyester & Spandex", "Imported", "Pull On closure", "Machine wash cold, Wash with like colors, Only non-chlorine bleach when needed, Tumble dry low heat, Cool iron if necessary", "USE CASE: Ladies, you can wear this comfortable compression shirt all day; It's slimming, flattering and low-profile, so only you know it's there; Great for workouts, running, pickleball, and when you need a little support", "SOOTHING COMPRESSION: Proprietary 4D stretch fabric can help everyday aches with gentle compression of your muscles and joints; When worn under layers, compression can provide a slimming and flattering appearance", "ALL-DAY COMFORT: Proprietary 4D stretch compression fabric delivers unrivaled stretch and recovery, for compression clothing so comfortable you'll want to wear it all day; With UPF 50 for added sun protection", "ODOR CONTROL: Patented Copper Znergy fabric technology provides increased odor control; It's 100% infused into all of our compression garments and won't wash out", "WICKING & BREATHABLE FABRIC: Lightweight Mens Compression V-Neck T Shirt is designed to wick sweat and breathe, so you stay dry and comfortable throughout the day"], "description": ["Tommie Copper's women's compression shirt uses compression to provide support for the muscles and joints in the neck, shoulders, torso and back.  ."], "price": 44.5, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Women", "Tops & Tees", "T-Shirts"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "37 x 32 x 0.25 inches; 1.5 Pounds", "Item model number": "0902WR", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "June 26, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Tommie Copper"}, "average_rating": 3.8, "rating_number": 23, "store": "Tommie Copper"}
