{"parent_asin": "B00JBOB3BQ", "title": "RVCA Women's Class Warfare Forever Tank Top Medium Black", "features": ["Imported", "Wash cold", "Manufactured by RVCA.", "A brand-new, unused, and unworn item (including handmade items) in the original packaging (such as the original box or bag) and/or with the original tags attached."], "description": ["RVCA Women's Class Warfare Forever Tank Top. The RVCA Class Warfare Forever Tank Top in Black You know that feeling you get when you see the perfect piece and you just have to have it? We know that's how you feel about the Class Warfare Forever Tank Top from RVCA. A lightweight polyester blend, center front graphics, and a slim fit make this an easy breezy style. Crewneck tank top Contrast graphic Machine wash cold 50% rayon, 50% polyester Imported By RVCA Model Stats Lauren is wearing a size Small. Our model Lauren is 5'9\" with a 34\" bust, 26\" waist and 35\" hips."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Women", "Tops & Tees", "Tanks & Camis"], "details": {"Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "April 25, 2014", "Manufacturer": "RVCA"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 1, "store": "RVCA"}
