{"parent_asin": "B093C1QR6W", "title": "Ross-Simons Italian Sterling Roped Ring", "features": ["ITALIAN STERLING SILVER — Italian sterling silver wide braided ring. Polished finish. 1/2 in. wide. Size 6.", "IDEAL FOR EVERYDAY WEAR — With its essential design, this braided ring wears well whether you’re running errands, in the office or out with the girls.", "MADE IN ITALY — Italian fine jewelry stands out for its unparalleled style and craftsmanship. Wear this luxurious ring, knowing it has been crafted to the highest quality standards in the world.", "THE PERFECT GIFT FOR HER — This is the ideal gift for your sister, daughter, mom, wife, niece, aunt, best friend, girlfriend — or yourself! Whether she prefers modern or traditional jewelry, Ross-Simons has a wide selection of bracelets, earrings, necklaces and rings to choose from.", "GIFT BOX INCLUDED — Ross-Simons jewelry arrives beautifully packaged in a gift box, ready to delight for any occasion, including birthdays, Christmas, Mother’s Day, anniversaries, Valentine’s Day, weddings, graduations and much more!"], "description": [], "price": 79.0, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Rings", "Statement"], "details": {"Item model number": "2364155", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "April 23, 2021", "Manufacturer": "Ross-Simons"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 181, "store": "Ross-Simons"}
{"parent_asin": "B0725NL65K", "title": "BVAGSS Women Rimless Oversized Studded Sunglasses Gradient Color Lens Rivet Fashion Lightweight Design WS027", "features": ["Metal frame", "Resin lens", "Non-Polarized", "UV Protection Coating coating", "Lens width: 2.56 inches", "Lens height: 2.24 inches", "Bridge: 17 millimeters", "1. [ UV400 Protection ]：Non-Polarized, 100% UV400 protection effectively protects your eyes from harmful UV radiation. Eliminate reflected light and scattered light and protect eyes perfectly.", "2. [ Rimless Design ]：The rimless design increases comfort and allows for greater freedom of movement.", "3. [ Gradient Color Lens ]: The studded sunglasses feature a gradient color design that is both stylish and practical, suitable for any occasion. Such as cycling, driving, shopping, traveling, hiking, and is suitable as high fashion accessory and daily wear all year round.", "4. [ Lightweight Design ]: The lightweight design makes the women's sunglasses more comfortable to wear without creating any pressure.", "5. [ Oversized Size ]: The large size design effectively blocks the sun and is more fashionable."], "description": [], "price": 15.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Accessories", "Sunglasses & Eyewear Accessories", "Sunglasses"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "4 x 2 x 2 inches; 3.2 Ounces", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "May 13, 2017"}, "average_rating": 4.6, "rating_number": 2414, "store": "BVAGSS"}
{"parent_asin": "B0761PQWRT", "title": "Frida Inspired Women's Purse, Wallet, and/or Matching Coin Purse", "features": ["Purse, Wallet, Coin Purse, or Wallet/Coin Purse Combo!", "Different types and dimensions for different uses: Great for cards, money, and phones", "Frida Kahlo inspired work"], "description": ["It is impossible to sum up in few lines the complexity and charm of Frida's life, but artist Frida Kahlo was born on July 6, 1907, in Coyocoán, Mexico City, Mexico. Considered one of Mexico's greatest artists, her life was marked by physical suffering, started with the polio contracted at the age of five and worsen by her life-dominating event occurred in 1925. A bus accident caused severe injuries to her body owing to a pole that pierced her from the stomach to the pelvis. The medicine of her time tortured her body with surgical operations (32 throughout her life), corsets of different kinds and mechanical \"stretching\" systems.  Lots of her works were painted laying in the bed. Because of these physical conditions Frida could not have children and this was devastating for her. Kahlo later became politically active and married fellow communist artist Diego Rivera in 1929. During her lifetime, Frida painted the diary of her life. She created some 200 paintings, drawings and sketches related to her experiences in life, her physical and emotional pain and her turbulent relationship with Diego. She produced 151 paintings, 55 of which are self-portraits. When asked why she painted so many self-portraits, Frida replied:", "\"Because I am so often alone....because I am the subject I know best.\"", "These Purses, Wallets, and Coin purses are inspired by her work, some mirroring her self portraits, and others influenced by it."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Accessories", "Wallets, Card Cases & Money Organizers", "Coin Purses & Pouches"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "8.03 x 4.17 x 1.65 inches; 5.61 Ounces", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "April 8, 2017"}, "average_rating": 4.4, "rating_number": 39, "store": "minky"}
