{"parent_asin": "B07P5TB7CB", "title": "lakiolins Little Girls Shiny Sequins Bowknot Mary Jane Ballet Flats Princess Dress Shoes", "features": ["Rubber sole", "Adorable dress flat shoes made for your princess! They're not only cute, but also comfortable!", "Sole / Padding: Synthetic non-skid sole / cushioned foot bed with padded insole.", "Perfect Dress Flat Shoes suit for Various occasions such as for a day at the kids birthday or party!", "Makes a perfect flower girl's dress shoes, birthday present or \"just because\" for your very own little love.", "Please ignore the size print on the shoes, we've converted our size to the US Size which would convenient for you to select."], "description": ["Item Type:Dress Shoes Season: Spring, Autumn,Winter Weight: 100g-150g(approx) Size: 9.5M/10M/10.5M/11.5M/12M US Toddler/Little Kid Note:Please choose the size by Sole Length, the age is just for reference. Specifications: Size-----------Sole Length 9.5M------------16cm/6.3\"  10M------------16.5cm/6.5\" 10.5M------------17cm/6.7\" 11.5M------------17.7cm/7.0\" 12M------------18.3cm/7.2\" Note: Please measure your baby's foot length to choose the right size for your baby because of the different measurement methods, there may be 1-2cm error. Thanks for your understand."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Girls", "Shoes", "Flats"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "7.4 x 4.02 x 2.83 inches; 5.29 Ounces", "Department": "Girls", "Date First Available": "March 6, 2019", "Manufacturer": "lakiolins"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 35, "store": "lakiolins"}
