{"parent_asin": "B004Y9DBU4", "title": "Chinese Laundry Women's Hot Desert Bootie", "features": ["100% Synthetic", "Manmade sole", "Shaft measures approximately 3.5\" from arch", "Heel measures approximately 4.25\"", "Platform measures approximately 1\"", "Boot opening measures approximately 10.25\" around"], "description": ["Simply sizzling, the Hot Desert bootie will draw attention from all corners. Brushed fabric gives this on-trend wedge a suppleness for nice contrast to structured and flowy pieces, and the ankle height adds wardrobe versatility, pairing brilliantly with pant and dress silhouettes. And yes, the knockout loft is ultra-flattering.", "Chinese Laundry launched in 1982 with a collection of fashion forward footwear targeted to the young women’s market. From stylish daytime looks in innovative fabrics and leathers, to evening collections in dressy metallics and iridescents, Chinese Laundry continues to create and deliver style and fashion at an affordable price. Chinese Laundry has carved a niche for itself in today's competitive market and is available in better department and specialty stores nationwide."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Boots", "Ankle & Bootie"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "12 x 8 x 4 inches; 2 Pounds", "Item model number": "HOT DESERT", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "June 11, 2011", "Manufacturer": "Chinese Laundry"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 4, "store": "Chinese Laundry"}
