{"parent_asin": "B01MXPF31Z", "title": "Kipling Womens Ravier Backpack, Sparkly Gold", "features": ["Pockets: 4 slip, 1 zip, 4 exterior"], "description": ["Gear up for every adventure big and small with our ravier backpack. It's kicked up with Cinch cord and magnetic closure for added security, adjustable back straps for customized comfort and multiple compartments to hold everything from your lip gloss to a flashlight."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Luggage & Travel Gear", "Backpacks", "Casual Daypacks"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "22 x 11 x 11 inches", "Item Weight": "1.3 Pounds", "Department": "Womens", "Manufacturer": "Kipling", "Item model number": "BP3872", "Best Sellers Rank": {"Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry": 3959538, "Casual Daypack Backpacks": 10006}, "Age Range Description": "Adult", "Capacity Total": "30 Liters"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 27, "store": "Kipling"}
{"parent_asin": "B01KJIPMX2", "title": "Breast Cancer Awareness Shirt - Survivor Pink Tshirt - Gift for Women Wear for Someone Special", "features": ["100% Cotton", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "PREMIUM QUALITY - These breast cancer shirts for women are made with 100% lightweight cotton and are designed for a premium quality experience. The eco-friendly, modern and flowy design of these breast cancer shirts for women ensure breathability and epitomize comfort for the fighter, survivor and supporter women.", "SYMBOLIZING SUPPORT - This womans breast cancer shirts are an ideal statement maker for those who long to show their support to loved ones. With the slogan printed on the shirts, these cancer awareness tshirts are perfect to celebrate survivors and raise awareness everyday.", "FOR WOMEN - Along with your support to proud fighters, you can wear this trendy breast cancer shirt as your warrior gear to flaunt your endurance in style.", "SIZE INFORMATION - You will like this shirt no matter what size you are. Find your right fit using the size chart and wear your support. We have sizes ranging from Small to 3XLarge, one for everyone. To make sure you get your right size, the drop down size menu also offers breast cancer awareness plus size shirts.", "EASY TO WASH - Forget the hassle of washing by hand. This inspiringly designed and fabricated t-shirt is machine friendly and easy to tumble dry. The fine imprinting and appropriate stretch in the shirt itself ensures an anti-fade and resistant material that is good to last you a long time."], "description": [], "price": 16.89, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Women", "Tops & Tees", "T-Shirts"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "August 16, 2016"}, "average_rating": 4.6, "rating_number": 159, "store": "Awkward Styles"}
