{"parent_asin": "B079997S9B", "title": "Dansko Women's Sam Sandal", "features": ["100% Leather", "Imported", "Foam sole", "Heel measures approximately 2 inches\"", "Platform measures approximately 1.0 inches", "Your favorite adjustable ankle strap sandal is back! Showcasing timeless Mary Jane styling, its open back and close toe make it a wise choice for multi-season style.", "Dril-lex sockling for moisture management", "Shock-absorbing foam midsole for all-day comfort", "Coring holes and cored-out forepart to reduce weight", "Beveled heel for stability on impact;"], "description": ["The sam sandal will take you easily from day to night! this open-heel, closed toe shoe is built with an eva insert for extra cushioning and has an adjustable leather hook and loop for the perfect fit."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Sandals", "Heeled Sandals"], "details": {"Item model number": "9840047000", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "January 25, 2018", "Manufacturer": "Dansko"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 1, "store": "Dansko"}
