{"parent_asin": "B00U6E8GVK", "title": "Jockey Men's Low-Rise No Fly Trunks Denim-Look Cotton, 2-Pack", "features": ["100% Cotton", "Machine Wash", "100% cotton for superior comfort and absorption", "Elastic legbands for a flexible fit , Double layer pouch for support", "Fitted: a close, snug fit for wear under slim pants", "Signature logo on elastic waistband, Easy care: machine wash and dry", "Sits at natural waist , Extends to top of thigh"], "description": ["Step into comfort when you put on men's underwear from Jockey. Crafted from premium cotton, these briefs are lightweight, extra soft, and breathable. Wear these trunk briefs and enjoy all-day comfort and support. Perfect for wearing under slim pants"], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Underwear", "Trunks"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "9.1 x 5.2 x 1.7 inches; 5.6 Ounces", "Department": "mens", "Date First Available": "March 2, 2015"}, "average_rating": 3.7, "rating_number": 56, "store": "Jockey"}
