{"parent_asin": "B00M8ZDMKA", "title": "Lucky Brand Women's Hibiscus", "features": ["100% Leather", "Imported", "Synthetic sole", "Shaft measures approximately 15.75\" from arch", "Heel measures approximately 1.5\"", "Boot opening measures approximately 14.5\" around", "Riding boot in pebbled leather featuring full-length vertical overlays topped with pull-tabs and chunky stacked heel", "Elasticized gore at back cuff"], "description": ["Rooted in rock 'n' roll with a signature sense of humor, Lucky Brand stands for independent thinking, individual style and a feeling as authentic as love. Friends since youth, creators Gene Montesano and Barry Perlman shipped the first order of Lucky Brand in 1990, and have been renowned for their great-fitting jeans and vintage-inspired apparel and accessories ever since."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Boot Shop", "Women", "Fashion", "Riding"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "5 x 5 x 5 inches; 1.3 Pounds", "Item model number": "Hibiscus", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "October 3, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Lucky Brand"}, "average_rating": 3.9, "rating_number": 136, "store": "Lucky Brand"}
{"parent_asin": "B0074CNVRQ", "title": "Clarks Women's Artisan Temp Appeal Platform Pump", "features": ["100% Leather", "Imported", "Leather sole", "Heel measures approximately 3\"", "Platform measures approximately 0.50\"", "Classic round-toe pump with stacked heel and platform", "Latex cushioned footbed", "Grippy outsole pattern", "Padded Achilles collar at ankle"], "description": ["From its humble beginnings in 1825 in the tiny English village of Street, Somerset, to a global company that manufactures and markets close to 35 million pairs of shoes a year, Clarks' commitment to comfort, quality, authenticity, and individual style has remained unchanged throughout the centuries."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Pumps"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "12 x 4 x 8 inches; 9 Ounces", "Item model number": "A Tempt Appeal", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "August 29, 2012", "Manufacturer": "Clarks"}, "average_rating": 4.0, "rating_number": 333, "store": "Clarks"}
{"parent_asin": "B08KSLK865", "title": "Pura Vida Silver or Rose Gold-Plated Reversible Enamel Wave Ring - Brass Band, Sizes 5-9", "features": ["FOUNDED IN COSTA RICA - Thoughtfully designed, each Pura Vida accessory is crafted by expert artisans in Costa Rica, El Salvador, India, and more. Our goal is to provide sustainable jobs to artisans worldwide and give back to causes you care about.", "REVERSIBLE WAVE DESIGN - Adorned with a Turquoise enamel wave, its beach-inspired design is perfect for the beach and tropical isles. The overlapping waves can be flipped upside down to match your mood for a summer trip or getaway!", "CHIC STAPLE ACCESSORY - The trendy ring to pair with a sundress or your beach ensemble, this charming piece puts you in the mood for vacationing and lounging. The lovely design lets you fall in love with the carefree, laid-back lifestyle.", "CAPTIVATING SILVER FINISH - This stylish accessory features a dazzling, eye-catching tone that adds life to your everyday outfit. Its beautiful, lustrous surface boasts a striking sheen that makes the ring an instant standout.", "STACKABLE RING - With its chic and flattering design, this staple piece will beautifully pair with any outfit. Match it with our bracelets or mix it with other rings and jewelry pieces to cop the ultimate beach babe look!"], "description": [], "price": 23.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Rings", "Bands"], "details": {"Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "October 6, 2020", "Manufacturer": "Pura Vida"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 139, "store": "Pura Vida"}
{"parent_asin": "B01NCQWMNU", "title": "Ray-Ban Man Sunglasses Black Frame, Blue Lenses, 63MM", "features": ["Plastic", "Imported", "Plastic frame", "Plastic lens", "Polarized", "UV Protection Coating coating", "Lens width: 63 millimeters", "Bridge: 15 millimeters", "Arm: 140 millimeters", "Features a new, innovative six-layer anti-reflection treatment that eliminates reflections and glare, while maximizing contrast to provide more vivid texture and contour.", "Plastic frame", "Polarized iridium (polycarbonate) Chromance lens", "Designed in Italy", "Case Included"], "description": ["RB4275CH Chromance Mirrored Square Sunglasses feature a lightweight, flexible nylon frame and square Chromance mirrored lenses. The Men's RB4275CH Chromance Mirrored Square Sunglasses feature a new, innovative six-layer anti-reflection lens treatment that eliminates reflections and glare, while maximizing contrast to provide more vivid texture and contour. . To protect your eyes from harmful UV rays, these sunglasses include lenses that are coated with 100% UV protection.", "Ray-Ban is the world's most iconic eyewear brand and is a global leader in its sector. Every model in the Ray-Ban collection is the product of meticulous, original styling that translates the best of the latest fashion trends into an ever-contemporary look for millions of Ray-Ban wearers around the world. From the early Aviator style that emerged in 1937 to the introduction of the classic Wayfarer in 1952, Ray-Ban is a brand that embodies America and adventure, great cities and wide-open spaces, heroism, individuality, and authenticity. Starting with a silver screen debut in 1961, Ray-Ban sunglasses have appeared throughout hundreds of films and have been a favorite on the Hollywood scene for years, both on and off the screen. With timeless and imaginative styles, Ray-Ban consistently blends high-tech design, lenses, and materials. The collection remains true to its classic heritage while continuously evolving to meet today's fashion demands."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Sunglasses & Eyewear Accessories", "Sunglasses"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "2.68 x 7.32 x 3.39 inches; 5.6 Ounces", "Item model number": "0RB4275CH", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "December 29, 2016", "Manufacturer": "Ray-Ban Sunglasses"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 18, "store": "Ray-Ban"}
{"parent_asin": "B07TRMX52P", "title": "Hanna Nikole Women Hoodie Casual Drawstring Pullover Plus Size Hooded Sweatshirt", "features": ["Lightweight Fabric: 60%Polyester+35%Cotton+5%Spandex,which is skin-friendly and breathable to your body", "Casual Style, designed for women hoodie feminine fitted stylish, Can be worn for casual or useful in hiding tummies when needed", "Suitable for any body shape people.Simple and fashion design,You never have to worry about outdated", "Perfect for daily life, party, beach, vacation,office,work or sports ,make you charming and cool.Suit for autumn,winter,spring.", "Garment care:Machine Wash Cold / Gentle Cycle / Tumble Dry Low", "Please double check product measurement in the pictures before ordering to ensure accurate fitting.Your satisfaction is our success,you will feel good for our perfect after-sales service!"], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Fashion Hoodies & Sweatshirts"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "13.4 x 10 x 2.2 inches; 15.2 Ounces", "Item model number": "HN0288-2_16W@#PLMFME", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "July 16, 2019"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 15, "store": "Hanna Nikole"}
{"parent_asin": "B078HBGFJJ", "title": "StyleDome Women's Casual Long Sleeve Lace Shirt Cold Shoulder Tops Basic Tee Crochet Blouses", "features": ["Polyester,Cotton,Spandex,Lace", "Pull On closure", "Hand Wash Only", "Material & Feature: The cold shoulder tops is made of Cotton, Polyester and Spandex, it is soft, comfy and skin-friendly. Round neck, short sleeve, long sleeve or bell sleeve, hits at hip, regular fit, crochet casual t-shirt, double hollow out on shoulder with striking floral lace.", "Size: US 8-10(Tag Size S), US 12(Tag Size M), US 14-16(Tag Size L), US 16W-18W(Tag Size XL),20W-22W(Tag Size 2XL)Please check carefully before you order this casual lace tops.", "Fashion Collocation: In summer, you can pair it with shorts, jeans, leggings, a hat and a pair of sandals. In the spring, you can wear a denim jacket and ankle boots. There will be different styles for different fashion collocations.Which will make you more unique during the whole season!", "Occasions: The summer cold shoulder tops is Suitable For Casual, Beach, Dating, Summer, Night outs, Party, Vacation, Holiday or Daily wearing , Also Perfect For Cool Spring .This Women's Casual Short Sleeve cold shoulder Shirt is casual, comfort and beautiful.", "Attention:Our tag sizes are ASIAN SIZE, Please check your size with our ORANGE SIZE CHART before you buy it. Size may be 2cm/1 inch inaccuracy DUE TO HAND MEASURE; Color may be little different due to monitor."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Tops, Tees & Blouses"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "0.04 x 0.04 x 0.04 inches; 8.01 Ounces", "Item model number": "STYLEDOMEWirzdolp24167", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "December 19, 2017", "Manufacturer": "StyleDome"}, "average_rating": 3.9, "rating_number": 793, "store": "StyleDome"}
{"parent_asin": "B081GDFWMS", "title": "Women's Disney Thumper Plush Velour 3-Piece Sleepwear Pajama Set", "features": ["100% Polyester", "Elastic closure", "Machine Wash", "One of your childhood favorite characters from the Disney movie, Bambi, Thumper pajama set", "Long sleeve top with the embroidered Thumper character", "Coordinating pants with a cute all over Thumper graphic", "Stay warm in fluffy socks with an adorable Thumper face", "100% Polyester; machine washable"], "description": ["Snuggle in and get cozy with one of your childhood favorite characters from the Disney movie, Bambi, Thumper pajama set. Spoil yourself or give this 3-piece set as a gift. In super soft velour, this set features long sleeve top with the embroidered Thumper character, coordinating pants with an all over Thumper graphic, and fluffy socks with an adorable Thumper face. Officially licensed Thumper pajama set is 100% polyester; machine washable."], "price": 32.07, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Lingerie, Sleep & Lounge", "Sleep & Lounge", "Sets"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "15 x 12 x 3 inches; 12 Ounces", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "November 13, 2019"}, "average_rating": 3.6, "rating_number": 12, "store": "Richard Leeds International"}
