{"parent_asin": "B001TA3TTY", "title": "The Finals TYR 9830A1844 Solid Butterfly-Back Red 44", "features": ["80% Nylon, 20% Spandex", "Imported", "Hand Wash Only", "One-piece swimsuit with high-cut legs and butterfly-style back", "Fully lined"], "description": ["Designed To Perform", "The Finals Women's butterfly back swimsuit features thin straps for an updated fit that's sure to perform. Constructed with Xtra Life LYCRA, this product is designed to counter the \"bag and sag\" of traditional swimwear, delivering added strength and support in and out of the water. Showcasing a beautiful, long lasting fit that stands up to the toughest workouts, The Xtra Life LYCRA butterfly back resists chlorine and other pool chemicals 5 to 10 times longer than unprotected elastane.", "Materials", "80% Nylon", "80% Nylon", "20% Xtra Life LYCRA Fiber (Fully Lined)", "20% Xtra Life LYCRA Fiber (Fully Lined)"], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Specific Clothing", "Competitive Swimwear", "Women", "One-Piece Suits"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "7.3 x 5.3 x 1.7 inches; 0.01 Ounces", "Item model number": "9830A1844", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "July 18, 2012", "Manufacturer": "TYR"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 3, "store": "TYR"}
