{"parent_asin": "B07CP14LQG", "title": "just one Women's Hooded Vest Faux Fur, Full Zipper, Front Side Pockets, Black White Sizes Small Medium Large XLarge", "features": ["Faux Fur", "Made in USA or Imported", "Zipper closure", "Hand Wash Only", "Women's Hooded Gilet Vest Faux Fur Full Zipper Side Pockets, White size Medium. Fashionable body warmer.", "STYLISH faux fur vest is the perfect layering piece keeping you cozy throughout the day, whether you wear it in a city or great outdoors. 2 inches between textured stripes.", "COMFORTABLE Wear it with a t-shirt on warmer lights, long sleeve tunic, sweater, cardigan, shirt, or warm blouse when the weather cools down.", "CUTE AND COZY style looks great with casual leggings or dressed up. Available sizes Small, Medium, Large, Extra Large. Available colors: Black and White."], "description": ["Women's Hooded Vest Faux Fur Full Zipper Side Pockets, White M. Fashionable body warmer. STYLISH faux fur vest is the perfect layering piece keeping you cozy throughout the day, whether you wear it in a city or great outdoors. 2 inches between textured stripes. COMFORTABLE Wear it with a t-shirt on warmer lights, long sleeve tunic, sweater, cardigan, shirt, or warm blouse when the weather cools down. CUTE AND COZY style looks great with casual leggings or dressed up. Available sizes Small, Medium, Large, Extra Large. Available colors: Black and White."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Coats, Jackets & Vests", "Fur & Faux Fur"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Package Dimensions": "14.45 x 12.6 x 3.7 inches; 1.03 Pounds", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "April 26, 2018"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 32, "store": "just one"}
{"parent_asin": "B007TQX8R0", "title": "Dr. Scholl's Women's Master Boot", "features": ["100% Suede Leather", "Imported", "Synthetic sole", "Shaft measures approximately 13.25\" from arch", "Heel measures approximately 1\"", "Boot opening measures approximately 13.25\" around", "Suede leather upper", "TPR outsole", "B2674L1-1, B2674L1-250, B2674L1-202"], "description": ["From the moment its iconic exercise sandals hit the shelves in 1968, Dr. Scholl's has been a brand synonymous with comfortable footwear and healthy feet. Today, Dr. Scholl's offers footwear in a variety of fashionable styles that range from casual to elegant, to fun and funky. Dr. Scholl's continues its tradition of using the latest podiatric medicine and research to revolutionize the way Americans think of, and care for, their feet."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Boot Shop", "Women", "Fashion", "Riding"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "15.2 x 11.6 x 4.7 inches; 3 Pounds", "Item model number": "Master", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "July 10, 2012", "Manufacturer": "Dr. Scholl's Shoes"}, "average_rating": 3.8, "rating_number": 22, "store": "Dr. Scholl's Shoes"}
