{"parent_asin": "B01K2RPMGC", "title": "Caterpillar Ellie Work Boot Women's", "features": ["100% Genuine Leather, Rubber", "Imported", "Rubber sole", "Genuine Leather upper", "EASE Comfort Cushioning system offers 30% more shock absorbtion and 30% more durable than EVA", "Slip resistant rubber outsole", "Electrical Hazard Rated", "Soft Toe"], "description": ["The perfect leather work boot at the perfect price. Ease comfort cushion system offers the comfort of a running shoe with the durability of a work boot. Slip resistant rubber outsole supplies sure footed traction in any condition. All the bells and whistles you would find in more expensive boots.", "As the world's foremost manufacturer of heavy equipment, Cat earthmovers are known around the world as a symbol of honest work, strength and integrity. Cat Footwear makes boots and shoes based on these same principals. The brand has evolved from work boots into a range of industrial and casual footwear built with the sole purpose of staying true to their original goal--creating genuine, hard-working boots and shoes."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Boots", "Ankle & Bootie"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "13.58 x 10 x 5.12 inches; 3.4 Pounds", "Item model number": "P74095", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "August 11, 2016", "Manufacturer": "Cat Footwear"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 29, "store": "Cat Footwear"}
