{"parent_asin": "B08YDM7J34", "title": "Toddler Kids Girl Outfits Baby Girls Skirt Set Ruffle Sleeves Solid Color Top+Skirt Summer Clothes Set", "features": ["Cotton Blend", "Pull On closure", "👧Material of toddler outfits summer: Cotton blend, soft hand feeling, sweat-absorbent breathable.", "👧Design of girls skirt set: 2pcs girls summer outfits, ruffle sleeves top matching with pleated skirt, there are bling bling dots within the fabric, so your little princess will be attractive and unique with this baby girl skirt outfit.", "👧Size of little girls summer clothes: 12-18 months/18-24 months/2t/3t/4t.1-5t baby girls summer outfits, toddler skirt outfit 5t. 4t girls outfits, 3t girls clothes, 5t girls clothes,girls 5t clothes,5t girls skirt sets.", "👧Package of girls overall summer: 1pc top T-shirt+1 skirt. toddler clothes for girls", "👧Occasion:Toddler summer outfits for girls Suitable for playing outside, birthday party,baby shower, baptism,wedding,baby photography,daily wear, family day or any occasion ,unique and attractive"], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Baby", "Baby Girls", "Clothing", "Clothing Sets", "Skirt Sets"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "9.45 x 8.98 x 1.38 inches; 5.61 Ounces", "Department": "baby-girls", "Date First Available": "March 9, 2021"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 24, "store": "JEELLIGULAR"}
{"parent_asin": "B09TGKBFCM", "title": "Fruit of the Loom Women's Breathable Underwear (Regular & Plus Size)", "features": ["91% Cotton, 5% Polyester, 4% Spandex", "Imported", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "Smooth, comfortable waistband. 100% Cotton liner. Colors May Vary.", "Wicks away moisture to keep you dry. Tag free.", "Breathable Micro-Mesh. Low Rise Brief", "Machine Wash. Seamless, no panty lines.", "Flexible 4 way stretch. Pull On closure."], "description": ["Fruit of the Loom breathable micro-mesh low rise briefs are just what you need to help you stay cool and fresh all day long. These panties are made with breathable, micro-mesh fabric that supports the flow of air but is modest enough to ensure you are fully covered. Not only will these underwear keep you feeling your best all day long, They're designed with comfort in mind. Soft leg bands and a smooth waistband provide extra comfort, and as always, our panties are tag free and made with a 100% cotton liner for extra softness. The women's low rise brief silhouette sits below the belly button and offers full seat coverage. Stock up on these Fruit of the Loom must-haves in our convenient 6 pack!"], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Lingerie, Sleep & Lounge", "Lingerie", "Panties", "Briefs"], "details": {"Item model number": "P000678371", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "February 25, 2022", "Manufacturer": "Fruit Of The Loom"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 1, "store": "Fruit of the Loom"}
