{"parent_asin": "B084ZJBV82", "title": "JASAMBAC Women's Boho Floral Print Soft Loose Flowy Summer Beach Casual Midi Skirt Green XL", "features": ["Drawstring closure", "【Material】: 95%Rayon+5%Viscose. Soft lightweight fabric, comfortable to wear. It flows really nicely, not too tight and not too loose", "【Designs】: high waist, elastic drawstring waistband, bohemian floral printed style, soft and lightweight fabric, A-line, no lining but not see through, maxi skirt, midi skirt, flowy skirts", "Very pretty, comfortable, cool. Removed the lining as it was too hot and clingy with that for summer (not see through so liner was not necessary). The fabric is soft and lightweight so easy to pack for vacation. Super adorable, vivid colors, pairs well with anything. Dress it up or down.", "【Occasion】: This chic and charming floral skirt is suitable for Dating, Party, Beach, Holiday, Wedding, Cocktail, Daily Casual. Perfect for Spring, Summer and Autumn.", "【Collocation】: This classic boho print skirt goes with everything. It is perfect for camisole or shirts. When the weather is cold, matching sweater and coat is a great choice. It will make you look super charming and elegant. Don't miss it."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Women", "Skirts"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "13.86 x 6.93 x 3.43 inches; 6.91 Ounces", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "February 19, 2020", "Manufacturer": "JASAMBAC"}, "average_rating": 2.8, "rating_number": 3, "store": "JASAMBAC"}
{"parent_asin": "B0898LQ31B", "title": "Hammitt 210 West", "features": ["Imported", "Department name: womens"], "description": ["The Hammitt® 210 West is a convenient way to store your cards and cash when you're on the go!", "The Hammitt® 210 West is a convenient way to store your cards and cash when you're on the go!", "Textured leather card case.", "Textured leather card case.", "Front side has five credit card slots and tab with snap closure.", "Front side has five credit card slots and tab with snap closure.", "Rear exterior identification slot and four extra card slots.", "Rear exterior identification slot and four extra card slots.", "Currency compartment with an interior lining and a top zip closure.", "Currency compartment with an interior lining and a top zip closure.", "Imported.", "Imported.", "Measurements:  Bottom Width: 3 in Depth: 1/4 in Height: 6 in Weight: 2.2 oz", "Measurements:", "Bottom Width: 3 in", "Bottom Width: 3 in", "Depth: 1/4 in", "Depth:", "1", "/", "4", "in", "Height: 6 in", "Height: 6 in", "Weight: 2.2 oz", "Weight: 2.2 oz"], "price": 125.0, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Accessories", "Wallets, Card Cases & Money Organizers", "Wallets"], "details": {"Brand": "Hammitt", "Color": "Black/Brushed Gold/Red", "Material": "Leather", "Style": "210 West", "Pattern": "Solid", "Date First Available": "February 1, 2018"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 8, "store": "Hammitt"}
