{"parent_asin": "B09NR5CY13", "title": "ARMEDES 3Pack Men's Athletic Compression Shirts Sleeveless AR-121 3PACK", "features": ["92% polyester, 8% polyurethane(spandex)", "Imported", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "【Sweat Wicking / Temperature Effect / Quick Dry】 The fabric of our AR-121 sleeveless compression shirt wicks moisture, preventing the shirt from sticking to your body allowing you to comfortably wear them and feel cool at all times.", "【92% Polyester, 8% Spandex 】 Non-abrasive, with tag less ARMEDES labels. Offers 50+ SPF sun protection, with excellent elasticity and durability for an enhanced range of motion.", "Our sophisticated, feed-off-the-arm sewing technique provides three-thread Flatlock stitch seams for that comfy second-skin fit.", "Compression fit for better fitness results! Note: Asian fitted sizes are smaller than American sizes, please refer to the size chart. Most buyers buy one size up! When confirming your size, make sure to read the US size chart, not Japan’s size chart", "Due to the specialty of the fabric, please wash separately first to avoid the risk of dye transferring to other clothing."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Base Layers"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "8.9 x 7.6 x 1.3 inches; 9.35 Ounces", "Item model number": "AR-121", "Department": "Unisex-adult", "Date First Available": "December 17, 2021", "Manufacturer": "ARMEDES"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 7, "store": "ARMEDES"}
{"parent_asin": "B00NNG6JHQ", "title": "Invicta Women's 13957SYB \"Angel\" Two-Tone Watch with Link Bracelet", "features": ["Stainless steel watch with white mother-of-pearl dial featuring flame fusion crystal inset bezel and date window at three o’clok position", "Swiss quartz movement with analog display", "Protective synthetic sapphire crystal dial window", "Features 18k gold ion-plated inner bezel, crown and outline of center link in bracelet", "Water-resistant to 100 m (330 ft)"], "description": ["With its most inspired creations yet, Invicta demonstrates its technical and design prowess, offering timepieces of style for extreme value.", "\"We have long held firm to the belief that supremely crafted timepieces can be offered for extremely modest sums. It is the founding principle of our flagship and the radical notion that still drives us today. By being true to our convictions, we will continue to turn the balance of power, and deliver true Swiss luxury to anyone who desires it. Let all those who possess our timepieces and pass through our doors witness the quality, value and care in every piece we create, and the spirit of never-ending possibilities in everything we do.\"", "These are the words that greet visitors and motivate team members inside the Invicta Watch Group's new worldwide headquarters. Emblazoned in stainless steel, it has been the Invicta message since Day One.", "With each new timepiece, the company sends up a flare for those looking to be defined not by how much they spend, but how wisely they spend. With its strong collections, the gutsy Swiss brand is guaranteed to keep attracting followers.", "It takes years of training and a great deal of pride to achieve glorious Swiss timepieces by hand. But it takes guts and the courage of your convictions to make those timepieces affordable for everyone who appreciates them.", "At our Swiss workshops, we mix time-honored traditions with a little bit of horse sense every single day to produce the greatest values in the watch-making world.", "Created in a blend of fashion and class, this Invicta timepiece exhibits a bold style that adds flare to your collection."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "7.3 x 5.9 x 5 inches; 1.8 Pounds", "Item model number": "13957SYB", "Department": "Womens", "Batteries": "1 Product Specific batteries required. (included)", "Date First Available": "October 3, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Invicta"}, "average_rating": 4.4, "rating_number": 4, "store": "Invicta"}
{"parent_asin": "B00LH3R8TA", "title": "KEEN Women's Reisen Lace Shoe, Red Dahlia, 6.5 M US", "features": ["100% Leather", "Made in the USA and Imported", "Rubber sole", "Heel measures approximately 1.25\""], "description": ["From beaches to mountains to city streets, Keen believes the outdoors is anyplace without a ceiling. Keen believes in living a HybridLife, which means being part of a greater community that is full of people who create possibilities, play in the outdoors and care for the world around them."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Fashion Sneakers"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "12 x 5 x 8 inches; 11.2 Ounces", "Item model number": "REISEN LACE-W", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "January 22, 2015", "Manufacturer": "KEEN"}, "average_rating": 3.3, "rating_number": 6, "store": "KEEN"}
{"parent_asin": "B00W2D1U2A", "title": "Simlu Women's Long Rayon Maxi Dress with Pockets, Scoop Neck and Empire Elastic Waist", "features": ["95% Rayon 5% Spandex PLEASE NOTE: Amazon size chart is inaccurate please refer to product description or image size chart for precise measurements", "Pull On closure", "Hand Wash Only", "COMFORT - This Long Rayon Maxi Dress composed of 95% Rayon, 5% Spandex and has a breezy and stretchy feel.", "MADE IN USA - Made with pride in USA to ensure you the utmost quality, comfort, and durability possible.", "OCCASION - This dress is form fitting on top and looser from the waist down, so you can dress it up according to any event you want it for and feel sexy and comfortable at the same time.", "COLOR VARIETY - Many exciting color options available to best suit your taste and style. Choose the colors that strike your fancy the most!"], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Dresses", "Casual"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "5 x 5 x 1 inches; 5 Ounces", "Item model number": "578819", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "April 13, 2015"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 286, "store": "Simlu"}
{"parent_asin": "B015PURVHY", "title": "Clorts Men's Hiking Shoe Outdoor Waterproof Walking Trekking Sneaker HKL831", "features": ["60% Leather/ 40% Mesh", "Imported", "Rubber sole", "🌟COMFORTABLE and LIGHT-WEIGHT : The hiking shoes is made of breathable mesh and high quality suede leather with high strength and excellent durability. No breaking in. Easy to walk in. Good arch support.", "🌟WATERPROOF and BREATHABLE : Hiking shoes featuring Uneebtex waterproof membrane and protective toe cap. Rubber toe cap offer greater protection and durability, and make walking more comfy. Keep your feet dry. Whether on wet stones, or gravelly and sand covered rocks.", "🌟SUPPORTIVE and STURDY : Rubber outsole with multi-directional traction, featuring skid-proof and abrasion-resistant; EVA midsoles supply excellent cushioning; Anatomically-shaped footbeds provide extra comfort, ventilation, better dampness absportion and less unpleasant odor.", "🌟OCCASION: Extensive occasion suited, ideal for hiking, backpacking, trekking, camping outdoor sports, urban leisure, walking, travelling.", "🌟NOTE : The hiking shoes run a bit small. Recommend ordering a half-size up or full size up from your normal size if your feet wide or wear hiking or thick socks. If the shoes do not fit you perfectly, all you need to do is to pack them in the original box and follow Amazon return procedure. If the shoes do not meet your expectation or you have any concerns, please do not hestitate to contact us because we are always here to help until problem completely solved!"], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Shoes", "Outdoor", "Hiking & Trekking", "Hiking Shoes"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "Yes", "Package Dimensions": "12.9 x 9.4 x 4.8 inches; 2.2 Pounds", "Item model number": "HKL-831E-Khaki-EUR44", "Department": "mens", "Date First Available": "September 23, 2015"}, "average_rating": 3.6, "rating_number": 7, "store": "Clorts"}
{"parent_asin": "B08LND87SB", "title": "6 Pieces African Scarf African Bandanas Face Covering Unisex Boho Neck Gaiter Balaclava Head Wrap for Motorcycling Outdoor Use", "features": ["100% Polyester", "Quantity and size: you will receive 6 pieces of sun protection bandana neck gaiters in our package, sufficient quantity for you to use, featuring nice elasticity, provide you a snug fit, one size fits for most sizes of heads and faces, keeping in place and won't slide off even when you're doing vigorous exercise", "Cool and chic style: these African face coverings bandanas are designed with different cool patterns which will make you look different and cool, there are more than 13 different dress ways for you to wear, like neck gaiter, head wrap, scarf, balaclava, face covering, beanie, sweatband or bandana, etc.", "Soft and breathable: our headband face coverings are made of quality polyester fabric, which can absorb sweat and dry very quickly, soft, lightweight and breathable to wear, protecting your face well in many kinds of outdoor activities without uncomfortable feeling", "Easy to carry and store: each sun protection neck gaiter measures approx. 48 cm/ 18.9 inch long and 24 cm/ 9.45 inch wide, which is lightweight and small enough in size, easy to roll up and put in all kinds of your bags and even pocket, convenient for you to carry around", "Practical accessories: the soft breathable face covering with moisture wicking fabric can help you transfer heat and humidity away from your body and outside of the bandana, ideal for various sports and outdoor activities, like running, hiking, walking, cycling, motorcycling, fishing, hunting, etc."], "description": ["6 Pieces African face covering bandanas unisex boho neck gaiter balaclava head wrap scarf for motorcycling outdoor useMulti-functional and practical: These multi-functional bandanas with different chic patterns will make you look distinctive and cool. What's more, our bandanas have more than 13 different dress ways. They can be worn as a neck gaiter, head wrap, face scarf, balaclava, face cover, beanie, sweatband or scarf bandana and so on.Widely applicable:Our soft breathable face cover with moisture wicking fabric can help you transfer heat and humidity away from your body and outside of the bandana, keep you cool and fresh in the hot summer days, at the same time, keep your face from getting burned from the sun, against wind and dust. Ideal for fishing, running, hiking, motorcycling, cycling and other outdoor sports or activities.Specifications:Quantity: 6 piecesMaterial: polyester fabricSize: approx. 48 x 24 cm/ 18.9 x 9.45 inchPackage includes:6 x Multi-functional bandana neck gaitersNotice:Manual measurement, please allow slight difference on size.There may exist slight color difference due to different screens, please in kind prevail.Knitted fabric has good elasticity. It is reasonable and normal to have a little change in color under the condition of stretching, which does not affect the use."], "price": 11.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Balaclavas"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "10.28 x 9.53 x 0.47 inches; 6.91 Ounces", "Department": "unisex-adult", "Date First Available": "October 22, 2020", "Manufacturer": "Syhood"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 397, "store": "Syhood"}
{"parent_asin": "B013Y0M5PU", "title": "Anne Klein Sport Women's Camrynne Fabric Wedge Pump", "features": ["100% Fabric", "Imported", "Synthetic sole", "Heel measures approximately 1.5\"", "Peep-toe pump featuring elasticized topline and wedge heel"], "description": ["Ak sport technology allows for a flexible fit that can bend up to 90 degrees.", "AK Anne Klein offers an impressive footwear collection offering unparalleled variety in an extensive range of sizes, colors, and styles that give each shoe a unique style and character. AK Anne Klein footwear provides fashion, quality, and comfort at an affordable price point that's perfect for every modern woman's lifestyle."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Pumps"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "11.6 x 6.2 x 4.1 inches; 10.08 Ounces", "Item model number": "CAMRYNNE FABRIC", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "November 4, 2015", "Manufacturer": "AK Anne Klein Sport"}, "average_rating": 4.1, "rating_number": 77, "store": "Anne Klein"}
