{"parent_asin": "B0BJTM7L7G", "title": "ALLOT Women Wedge Sandals Mules Slippers Sliders ladies Comfy Slip On Platform Dressy Summer Open Toe Low Heel Casual Beach Shoes", "features": ["Rubber sole", "QUALITY MATERIAL: Slides sandals are made of durable PU upper and a non-slip outsole, lightweight and breathable design bring your feet comfort and coolness.", "PERFECT DESIGN: Women's sandals with a velcro strap that adjust the width according to your wide foot for a better fit on the instep. Wedge heel gives you leg-lengthening height while keeping you comfortable all day.", "LASTING COMFORT: The fashion sandals is adopted a comfortable cushioned insole that snuggles your feet to provide comfort with every step.", "DURABLE & ANTI-SKID SOLE: We adopted a more comfortable and soft sole，exceptional support and cushion. Sexy toes, rubber soles, and non-slip design allow you to walk freely and safely in any weather.", "MATCH: Fashion style is easy to be paired with any dress, skirt, jeans and accessories. Whether you are daily life, party, wedding, date, dress, travel, shopping, work, vacation, school and so on, our shoes add perfection to your look."], "description": [], "price": 26.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Sandals", "Slides"], "details": {"Date First Available": "October 20, 2022"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 21, "store": "ALLOT"}
