{"parent_asin": "B07CB4N9B4", "title": "Have It Tall T Shirts for Men and Women | Cotton Short Sleeve | Sizes S - 6XL", "features": ["100% Heavyweight Super Soft Ring Spun Cotton - Softer AND Longer Lasting", "Made in USA", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "PERFECT FIT: Our crew neck T shirts feature an extra 3 inches at the hem and additional length in the sleeves, making them ideal for tall men or women. The sizes are custom made for long torsos, so that even the tallest person can achieve a fitted look, without paying for a tailor.", "LARGE ASSORTMENT: Available in two styles, these comfy tees are designed to suit any wardrobe. The simple designs come in assorted colors, from dark to light. These colorful choices make thoughtful gifts for teenagers or adults.", "SOFT, LONG-LASTING CONSTRUCTION: Our shirts are double stitched along the hem, collar, and sleeves, to guarantee the quality will last longer. Unlike standard T shirts, Have it Tall shirts are preshrunk, so you can wash and dry your tee without worrying about shrinkage.", "CASUAL APPAREL: All of our shirts are proudly made with fine spun and absorbent cotton. These super soft shirts are perfect for any occasion, from a business casual day at the office, to a relaxed evening at home. This staple will quickly become your favorite wardrobe essential.", "RISK-FREE PURCHASE: You deserve to Have it Tall. If you aren’t completely satisfied with your T shirt, we will gladly refund you up to 30 days after purchase."], "description": ["If you have ever grimaced at the question, “what’s the weather like up there?” or groaned when you were asked to move to the back of a photo, then our specialty T shirts are for you. With Have it Tall’s unique clothing line, you don’t need to buy the size up when you can buy the size that fits you just right. We’ve designed a super soft, extra strong T shirt that actually fits tall people. The extra length in the hem and sleeves allows you to feel comfortable and confident, because you deserve classic attire that was built with your body in mind."], "price": 24.95, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Men", "Shirts", "T-Shirts"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Item model number": "HIT-AT", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "November 23, 2016"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 20, "store": "Have It Tall"}
{"parent_asin": "B00ZTXF23S", "title": "Skechers Women's Reggae T Strap Sandal", "features": ["100% Mesh", "Imported", "Rubber sole", "Heel measures approximately 1.25\"", "Platform measures approximately 0.75 inches", "Slide sandal with woven T-strap upper featuring solid trims and adjustable hook-and-loop strap"], "description": ["Don't forget to shoot the deputy in Skechers' Reggae-Rockfest sandal. The breezy mesh upper keeps you cool while the flexible sole delivers a smooth, easy stride.", "Skechers is an award-winning global leader in the lifestyle footwear industry that designs, develops, and markets lifestyle footwear that appeals to trend-savvy men, women and children. The company's success stems from it's high quality, diversified, and affordable product line that meets consumers' various lifestyle needs. Since it's inception in 1992, the Skechers diverse product offering has grown from utility style boots to include seven Skechers brands and five uniquely branded fashion lines for men and women."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Sandals", "Flats"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "12.1 x 7.3 x 4.5 inches; 8 Ounces", "Item model number": "40788", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "December 28, 2015", "Manufacturer": "Skechers"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 2245, "store": "Skechers"}
{"parent_asin": "B08LD7GL7S", "title": "Kids Wide Brim Sun Protection Fishing Hat with Wire, Bucket Sunhat for Boys and Girls Outdoor Activities", "features": ["100% Nylon", "Buckle closure", "[SIZING] 2 Sizes Available. Size S/M for Age 2-4, Head Circumference of 20-21 inches (52-54cm), Size L/XL for Age 5-8, Head Circumference of 20.5-22.5 inches (55-58cm). The Elastic buckle and Pony tail hole behind the hat adjust the hats for the most comfortable size.", "[EXCELLENT SUN PROTECTION] 99.9% UV cut, UPF50+ rating Fabric. 3-3.5 inch (8-9cm) of Wide Brim with Wire covers face and neck perfectly. And a Chin Strap keeps a hat Stay-on Safe.", "[WHISTLE CORDLOCK] Patented Cordlock and Whistle in One can be useful in emergency and also have fun with a whistle in outdoor activities.", "[PREMIUM MATERIALS] Outer Fabric is Water-resistant, Stain-resistant, Quick-drying and Lightweight. The inner premium Sweatband is made by Coolmax by Dupont, absorbing sweats quickly and drying fast. Mount of hats are made by breathable, punched fabric that allows heat to escape and air to flow.", "[VERSATILE & FUNCTIONAL] Light-weight sunhat with flexible wide brim can be Packed Flat or Rolled into a Cone for Easy Carrying and Storage in Travel. This fashion functional sun hat is the best choice for traveling and outdoor activities such as fishing, exploring, hiking, trail, camping, gardening, picnic etc."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Girls", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "13.78 x 13.78 x 3.35 inches; 3.53 Ounces", "Department": "Unisex-child", "Date First Available": "October 27, 2020"}, "average_rating": 4.7, "rating_number": 65, "store": "SUN GLADE"}
{"parent_asin": "B00DSKXBI2", "title": "Miami Long Sleeve Tee by Orange Standard", "features": [], "description": ["This stylish G3104 Miami tee has a burnout fabric design which is great for layering. Wear under your scrubs for added style as it has slight shaping for a flattering fit. Sheer 55/45 cotton/poly jersey knit burnout fabric."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Uniforms, Work & Safety", "Clothing", "Medical"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "9.7 x 6 x 1.6 inches; 5.6 Ounces", "Item model number": "G3104-1", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "June 24, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Orange Standard"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 3, "store": "Orange Standard"}
{"parent_asin": "B07CMF1Z5Y", "title": "AMERICAN ACTIVE Men's 3 Pack 100% Cotton Fleece Lined Base Layer Long Sleeve Thermal Crew Neck Shirt", "features": ["100% Cotton", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "PREMIUM PACK OF 3 LONG SLEEVE TOPS / Mix and Match Tops - 100% Combed Ring-spun Natural Breathing Cotton with a Slight Soft Fleece Inner Side Brush", "PREMIUM MID WEIGHT FLAT KNIT WARM FABRIC ; Perfect Base Layer or Sleep / Lounge Thermal", "PREMIUM COMFORT;Unique Soft brushed back fabrication provides ultra-comfortable wear /Sturdy seam construction for added strength and durability with smooth, flat no rub seams to prevent chafing.", "BODY SNUG FIT; Flexible Body Form Fit Sport Flat Surface Design / Snug fit ensures no bunching around your waistline & legs reducing heat loss./ Cotton Spandex Comfortable Rib Knit Leg Opening and Wrist Cuffs stretch to keep their shape.& hold in place / Tag Free Comfort", "EASY CARE ; Machine Wash"], "description": ["These 100% Natural Breathing Cotton BaseLayer Thermal Crew Neck Long Sleeve Tops provides everything in luxury, comfort, and warmth, all at an affordable price in a premium quality 3 pack. The Innerside has a slight brush for extreme softness and breathability. Coming in Premium Value Pack of 3 Mix and Match Tops in brilliant colors they are the perfect compliment to any wardrobe."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Underwear", "Thermal Underwear", "Tops"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "10 x 7 x 2 inches; 1 Pounds", "Item model number": "AA472X3", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "April 24, 2018"}, "average_rating": 4.0, "rating_number": 584, "store": "AMERICAN ACTIVE"}
{"parent_asin": "B005EW0YFA", "title": "nOir Jewelry \"New Novelty\" Rose Gold and Purple Cocktail Ring", "features": ["Gorgeous new cocktail ring featuring hammered stud details with big purple stone", "Ring is made of solid brass plated in rose gold with a hammered finish and cubic zirconia stone", "Try to keep out of water. Store in cloth bag", "Made in China"], "description": ["Designer and renowned stylist Leeora Catalan launched Noir Jewelry in 1995 after working for Ralph Lauren and Oscar de la Renta. With an edgy look that's caught the eye of such fashion icons as Lady Gaga, Madonna, Rihanna, and Sarah Jessica Parker, Noir Jewelry offers unique statement pieces that are the forefront of urban-chic style. In fact, Noir Jewelry has collaborated with Marc Jacobs, DKNY, and Moschino to create exclusive pieces for their runway shows."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Rings", "Statement"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "2 x 2 x 1.9 inches; 3.2 Ounces", "Item model number": "RG9321-PARENT", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "January 1, 2011", "Manufacturer": "nOir"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 2, "store": "nOir Jewelry"}
