{"parent_asin": "B0BX5RDBBG", "title": "OJK Gifts for Mom,925 Sterling Silver I Love You Forever Heart Mom Pendant Necklace with Crushed Ice Birthstone,Birthday,Anniversary,Christmas,Mothers Day Jewelry Gifts for Women Mom", "features": ["Gifts for Mom", "Necklaces for Mom", "Jewelry for Mom", "Birthday Giftsf or Mom", "Mothers Day Gifts for Mom", "❤ Gifts for Mom ❤ When you're looking to pick a gift for your mom, this heart-shaped Crushed Ice necklace is perfect for you! Find your mom's birthstone based on your mom's birthday. It can bring happiness and good luck to your mom.", "❤ I Love You Forever Mom Necklace Size ❤ Mom Pendant size 0.97inch*0.92inch, Weight: about 5.5g,Chains Size:18+2 inches.We design this heart necklace, minimalist and delicate, fit for women,teen girls,friend,girlfriend,mom,mother and grandma.", "🎁 Perfect Mom Birthstone Gifts 🎁 This mother necklace represents your deep love for your mother. The best gift for anniversary, Valentine's Day,birthday, Christmas and Mother's Day. Suitable for daily and various party occasions.", "【Jewelry Gifts for Mom】 Birthstone Necklace Reflect the light beautifully, Wearing it you will be the focus in any occasions. Wonderful gift for friends, mother, wife, grandma, girlfriend, sister on Birthday Mother's Day, Engagement, Wedding and Anniversaries, Valentine, Christmas .", "【Quality Customer Service 】 We promise you will get a 100% satisfaction on Problem Solving. If you have any questions about the OJK Jewelry after-sales, please feel free to contact customer service at any time, we will reply with a satisfactory solution within 48 hours."], "description": [], "price": 76.86, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Jewelry", "Necklaces", "Pendant Necklaces"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "2.95 x 2.95 x 0.71 inches; 8 Ounces", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "March 1, 2023", "Manufacturer": "OJK"}, "average_rating": 4.8, "rating_number": 18, "store": "OJK"}
{"parent_asin": "B09YGKJ49Q", "title": "Lapetus Waterproof Hooded Lightweight Rain Poncho for Adults Women Men with Pockets Unisex Fashion Zipper Jacket Coat", "features": ["100% Polyester", "Imported", "Polyester lining", "Zipper closure", "Hand Wash Only", "[PREMIUM WATER PROOF MATERIAL] : This quality rain poncho is made of 100% eco-friendly, non-toxic and odor-free polyester fabric that is not only extremely waterproof but also is reusable for long periods of time. Every time you wear it, you will find it tear resistant, durable, water proof, quick-drying but still breathable and comfortable.", "[THOUGHTFULLY DESIGNED FOR YOU] : This rain poncho is featured with a wide brim hat hooded with drawstrings, keeping your whole body dry in the rain. The zipper closure in the front and 4 snap buttons on each sleeve with an elastic strap are convenient and secure. Its front pocket is quite roomy to store your small objects and keep them dry in rainy days.", "[PORTABLE AND COMPACT] : It is lightweight with only 10 OZ and easy to be folded in small size into a color matched pouch. It is a good protector for both travel and general purposes. Suitable for all seasons and outdoor activities, like hiking, camping, fishing, walking, sports and more.", "[PRATICAL AND FASHINABLE] : Elegant surface is in multiple patterns for your choice, giving you fresh feeling and adding a perfect beauty in the rain. One size fits most, perfect for adults, teens, men and women.", "[HIGH QUALITY PRODUCT] : Our products are carefully tested to ensure the highest levels of performance and the finest quality. If you are not completely satisfied, our hassle free return policy shows our confidence and commitment to your satisfaction."], "description": [], "price": 22.68, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "0.1 x 0.1 x 0.1 inches; 1.6 Ounces", "Item model number": "TLM99", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "April 21, 2022", "Manufacturer": "Lapetus"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 61, "store": "Lapetus"}
