{"parent_asin": "B07FKRDSS8", "title": "Amazon Essentials Men's Tech Fleece Open Bottom Pant", "features": ["67% Cotton, 33% Polyester", "Imported", "Machine Wash", "Train in confidence and comfort with this classic fleece pant", "On-seam side pockets, open bottom, reflective logo hit", "The perfect blend of cotton and polyester for lightweight warmth and comfort", "Sport made better: we listen to customer feedback and fine-tune every detail to ensure quality, fit, and comfort"], "description": ["An Amazon brand-A relaxed straight leg and elastic waistband bring lounge-ready style to this classic casual pant", "Amazon Essentials keeps you moving from the moment you step out the door. You'll find performance tees, hoodies, gym shorts, and more made with quality fabrics at stock-up prices. Whether you're heading out for a jog or running errands with the kids, our apparel is made to work out, live in, and lounge."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Men", "Pants"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "12.6 x 10.31 x 2.36 inches; 13.55 Ounces", "Item model number": "AM4028", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "January 21, 2019", "Manufacturer": "Amazon Essentials"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 551, "store": "Amazon Essentials"}
