{"parent_asin": "B06XSJ5VNV", "title": "Kelis Teeth Spiked Ball Weight, Surgical Steel Oval Shaped Ball Weights", "features": ["Pain is Pleasure and the Kelis Teeth Spiked Ball Weight will prove it to you again and again as you expand your erotic games and let your imagination run wild with no limits!", "Ready for some CBT (Cock and Ball Torture)? Get Kelis Teeth Spiked Ball Weight and let the pleasure, or pain begin!", "This Oval shaped weight is made from 316LVM Surgical Steel and measures in at 25mms (Height) x 26mms (Short Inside Diameter) x 52mms (Long Inside Diameter).", "This weight also boast 4 fully adjustable spiked screws (2 on each side), and a ring on the top of the weight that can serve multiple purposes as you let your imagination run wild.", "It comes with 2 Allen Wrenches one for adjusting the screws, and one for opening the weight. Let the pain/pleasure flow during your s ex ual adventures with this beauty! How much can you take???"], "description": ["Get the", "Kelis Teeth Spiked Ball Weight", "and start exploring your pain/pleasure fantasies!This baby will not disappoint as it promises and delivers erotic pain/pleasure sensations that will leave you begging for more!This Oval shaped weight is made from 316LVM Surgical Steel and measures in at:25mms (Height) x 26mms (Short Inside Diameter) x 52mms (Long Inside Diameter).This weight also boast 4 fully adjustable spiked screws (2 on each side), and a ring on the top of the weight that can serve multiple purposes as you let your imagination run wild.It comes with 2 Allen Wrenches one for adjusting the screws, and one for opening the weight."], "price": 46.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men"], "details": {"Material": "Stainless Steel", "Brand": "TheChainGang", "Water Resistance Level": "Waterproof", "Product Care Instructions": "Hand Wash", "Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Item model number": "TCG-GD-KTSBW-01", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "March 22, 2017", 