{"parent_asin": "B01KW0W3LG", "title": "Orvis Sweater Fleece Vest", "features": ["Polyester,Fleece", "Zipper closure", "Polyester Sweater Fleece fabric for overall comfort", "Excellent layering piece in cooler weather", "Two handwarmer pockets", "Chest pocket provides storage space for valuables", "Proven insulation for ensured warmth"], "description": ["A longtime favorite, the sweater fleece fabric we use in our vest combines the traditional look of a sweater with the proven insulation qualities of polyester fleece. This vest makes for an effective layer on cool days and when paired with a heavier jacket or shell boosts the warmth factor to impressive levels. Detailed with two handwarmer pockets, one chest pocket, all zippered for security. Classic fit. Polyester. Washable. Imported. Sizes M(38-40), L(42-44), XL(46-48), XXL(50-52)."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Jackets & Coats", "Vests"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "19 x 13 x 4 inches; 14.4 Ounces", "Item model number": "2BYK3153", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "September 20, 2017", "Manufacturer": "Orvis"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 39, "store": "Orvis"}
{"parent_asin": "B0BL1WCLT3", "title": "Pop Threads La Cerveza Beer Mexican Lottery Parody Funny Graphic Tee T-Shirt for Men", "features": ["100% Cotton", "Made in the USA and Imported", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "Perfect for wearing on vacation or on a cruise with your amigos.", "men women drinking drunk party", "See size chart image for details", "Graphic tee shirts available in a wide range of colors from basics to brights to heathers. Big and tall graphic tees up to size 6XL! Direct to Garment printing allows the specialty inks to be absorbed directly into the fibers of the apparel which ensures quality, vibrant colors, and a long lasting image on your clothing. Plus, you get premium pre-shrunk ring-spun cotton with reinforced double-needle stitching for soft comfort and durability on most novelty tee shirts (heathers are a poly blend).", "Quality Inks - All the inks we use are Oeko-Tex certified which means they are thoroughly tested for an harmful chemicals. The testing includes regulated and non-regulated substances and the standards usually exceed national limits."], "description": ["Premium item is designed and printed with pride in the USA! Our designs are printed with a slight distressed look for styling."], "price": 17.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty & More", "Clothing", "Novelty", "Men", "Shirts", "T-Shirts"], "details": {"Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "July 12, 2019"}, "average_rating": 4.4, "rating_number": 24, "store": "Pop Threads"}
