{"parent_asin": "B09L5L9463", "title": "STEELEMENT. Women’s Puffer Jacket, Lightweight Long-Sleeve Full-Zip Jacket Winter Stand Collar Packable Short Down Coats", "features": ["polyester", "Imported", "Zipper closure", "Hand Wash Only", "Size Guide:Please refer the size chart before ordering. XS=US 0-4, S=US 4-6, M=US 8-10, L=US 12-14. Loose fit, model is 5' 6\" and wears a size XS.", "Leisure and fashion Puffer Jacket, windproof shell with soft and warm cotton inside, ribbed knit cuffs, Stand Collar and Full-Zip. Two zippered pockets for easy storage and protect your hands from frostbite.", "Occasion: These solid colored Puffer jackets go well with anything,Pair well with sweaters, shirts, dress, jeans, gloves, boots, or sneakers. Perfect for skiing, snowboarding, outdoor exercise, traveling, shopping, holiday, casual wear during the autumn, winter, or early spring."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Coats, Jackets & Vests", "Down Jackets & Parkas"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "12.99 x 12.91 x 5.75 inches; 2.05 Pounds", "Department": "Women", "Date First Available": "November 6, 2021"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 39, "store": "STEELEMENT."}
{"parent_asin": "B0BBLJ36KP", "title": "Sincere Party Cute Cat Costume Dresses for Girls,Halloween Cat Cosplay Dresses with Accessories", "features": ["100% Polyester", "Imported", "Pull On closure", "Hand Wash Only", "Girls Cat Costume Completed Set--this cat costume is perfect for your little one for this Halloween, packaging comes with a cat dress,a cotton adjustable face mask,a matched pink spandex tights, a pink ears headband ,a dechable tail to transform your little one to a cutest miss meow girl.", "Perfect Construction--The black long sleeve cat dress features with pink sequins emb cat face at the front bodice, the skirt tutu is made with pink and black tulles mixed, underneath there is a black satin layer. The cotton face mask features with a pink print,which is so cute and comfortable for wearing due to the cotton breathable fabrics and adjust ear loops.", "Superior Quality--this cat dress set for girls are valuable,comfortable and durable for times of washing. The dress is made of velour and tulles 100% polyester fabric, higher fabric weight comparing with typical costumes. The face mask is made of cotton and breathable knit lining layer with insert pocket, washable and resuable for daily wear . The pink tights is made of arylic, super stretchy and soft .", "Perfect Cat Dress for Halloween--we have 3 different styles of cat dresses for girls,they are adorable and comfortable.The dresses are similar construcions with different pattern on bodice,they all feature with a long black velour sleeves,velcro release loop at back neck.The skirts are with different patterns.You could let your little one choose their own favorite style.", "4 Size Ranges --our cat dresses are produced in 4 size ranges for toddlers 2-3, Toddlers 3-4, Kids 5-6, Kids 7-8. They are true to size ,please follow the size chart guidance to select more suitable one."], "description": [], "price": 24.99, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Costumes & Accessories", "Kids & Baby", "Girls", "Costumes"], "details": {"Department": "Girls", "Date First Available": "August 23, 2022", "Manufacturer": "SP Funworld"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 42, "store": "Sincere Party"}
