{"parent_asin": "B08PPJB74Z", "title": "AMPOSH Women's Maternity Tank Top Ruched Side Sleeveless Pregnancy Basic Shirt", "features": ["Solid & Striped: 95% Cotton, 5% Spandex; Floral: 95% Rayon, 5% Spandex.", "The fabric is highly elastic, please order your pre-pregnancy size.", "Pull On closure", "Machine Wash", "SIZE fits for bust[Small]34-36\" [Medium]36-38\" [Large]38-40\" [X-Large]40-42\" [XX-Large]42-44\"", "FLATTERING FITTED DESIGN: Ruched sides, flattering fitted style, neither too thin nor too thick material, this cute and classic maternity tank is going to be your wardrobe hero.", "PLENTY OF ROOM: Crafted in super soft and comfy stretch fabric, gently ruched at the sides, this must-have maternity top will offer plenty of room for your growing bump.", "VERSATILE OCCASIONS: Layer under jumpers and jackets, it is ideal for work, evenings out or just around the house, providing enough comfort during pregnancy and beyond.", "MATERIAL & CARING: Solid & Striped: 95% Cotton, 5% Spandex; Floral: 95% Rayon, 5% Spandex. Breathable, but not see through. Machine wash cold, gentle cycle."], "description": ["You will never have too many basic maternity tops, especially when they’re", "extra soft & comfy", ".", "Whether it's for warm days, or to layer under jumpers and jackets, this maternity undershirt is a true", "wardrobe hero", ".", "Designed in a slim fit and with", "stretchy ruching detai", "l to ensure it fits beautifully throughout your pregnancy.", "Occasions", ": Comfortably wear it in the office, gym, or at home. Perfect for workout, prenatal yoga, sleepwear, and daily casual wear."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Maternity", "Tops & Tees", "Tanks & Camis"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "11.46 x 9.29 x 1.02 inches; 4.97 Ounces", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "December 4, 2020", "Manufacturer": "AMPOSH"}, "average_rating": 4.5, "rating_number": 584, "store": "AMPOSH"}
