{"parent_asin": "B014EC5YJ6", "title": "Nike Womens Air Zoom Pegasus 32 Gmm Bl/White/Lsr Orng/Vvd Orng Running Shoe 6 Women US", "features": ["Mesh"], "description": ["The Nike Air Zoom Pegasus 32 Women's Running Shoe delivers highly responsive cushioning and lightweight support to help you find your fastest run. Responsive Cushioning A Nike Zoom Air unit in the heel combines pressurized Nike Air and internal fibers to create cushioning that springs back fast—so you move fast. Breathable Support The engineered mesh upper provides ventilation and support where you need it most. Flywire cables wrap the midfoot and arch for added support and a secure, comfortable fit. Smooth Transitions A crash rail underfoot acts as a cushioning device upon impact to help smooth out your footstrike. More Benefits Partial mesh inner sleeve wraps your foot for plush comfort Internal heel counter secures the back of your foot Cushlon foam midsole provides soft and springy yet responsive cushioning Waffle outsole for durability and multi-surface traction Shoe weight: 8.6 ounces (women's size 8)"], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Fashion Sneakers"], "details": {"Is Discontinued By Manufacturer": "No", "Product Dimensions": "13.1 x 8.2 x 4.5 inches; 12 Ounces", "Item model number": "749344-401", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "March 29, 2016"}, "average_rating": 4.4, "rating_number": 2, "store": "Nike"}
