{"parent_asin": "B00XO6VB3C", "title": "Link Kids Kesha58 Gladiator Roman Golden Strap Comfort Flat Sandal Shoes", "features": ["Material: All Synthetic & Manmade Sole", "Rubber sole", "Fitment: For little girls / True to size", "Features: An open toe, an unique strappy design adorned with soft PU golden bands, and a faux leather upper. Finished with a slightly cushioned insole for comfort wear, a rubber sole carry you with stability and traction, and a back zipper allows quick and easy on/off.", "Low Heel 0.5\", Shaft w/o Heel 3.0\", Top Opening Circumference 6.5\" (Measurements may vary slightly.)", "Please note that the fit and color may vary slightly according to the style and moniter settings."], "description": ["Your baby is going to love her stylish gladiator inspired summer sandals. Featuring an open toe, an unique strappy design adorned with soft PU golden bands, and a faux leather upper. Finished with a slightly cushioned insole for comfort wear, a rubber sole carry you with stability and traction, and a back zipper allows quick and easy on/off."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Girls", "Shoes", "Sandals"], "details": {"Department": "girls", "Date First Available": "May 15, 2015"}, "average_rating": 4.6, "rating_number": 9, "store": "J.J.F Shoes"}
{"parent_asin": "B09J8XDLV2", "title": "ALBERTO CABALE Silk Scarf Women Anti-allergy Fashion Elegant Floral Shawl Gift for Ladies", "features": ["Cashmere,Silk", "Machine Wash", "🧣【 PREMIUM QUALITY 】: Our blended scarves are made from cashmere sourced directly from the high plains of Mongolia, where the finest cashmere goats are raised. We select our raw material with special care to ensure the good quality of our scarves once finished. No environmentally harmful products are used during the manufacturing process. Dimensions: 180 x 65 cm.", "🛍️【 INSPIRED BY MILANESE FASHION 】: Much more than a simple fashion accessory, the cashmere scarf is an indestructible that can easily sublimate any outfit. Endlessly versatile and available in 11 different colors, our cashmere shawls are designed in Italy and will allow you to adopt a chic and distinguished look without ever neglecting your well-being.", "🐑【 A UNIQUE SENSATION OF SOFTNESS 】: Ideal for keeping you warm during long winter days or for cool mid-season evenings, cashmere can be worn all year round. Thinner than a newborn's hair, cashmere allows our scarves to leave you feeling light on your shoulders. One thing is for sure, you won't regret your purchase.", "🧼【 CARE & CLEANING 】: In order to keep your cashmere scarf in the same condition as the first day, we recommend hand washing your product with a special cashmere shampoo or other suitable product. If you want to machine wash, then choose a cold program (< 30°C) where the spin speed does not exceed 500 rpm.", "💝【 DIRECTLY READY TO GIFT 】: We take special care of our products but also our packaging. Delivered directly in its gift box directly ready to give, our cashmere scarf represents the best gift idea for the arrival of the holidays. Whether it is for Christmas, a birthday or Valentine's Day, be sure to please your loved ones with this unique gift."], "description": ["A timeless classic, the cashmere scarf remains an exceptional product that symbolizes luxury and high-end. Whether it is to please one of your loved ones or to enjoy the incomparable softness yourself, the cashmere scarf is a must-have in your wardrobe. ⸻⸻⸻🧵 Who we are Born in 1914 in Turin, Alberto Cabale is a renowned designer who has been able to share his vision of fashion via his creations. Based on elegance and high quality, his collections have contributed to the renown of Italian fashion through the ages. Today it is Sarah, Alberto's granddaughter who has taken over the reins of the family business and is carrying on the tradition.⸻⸻⸻🐐 A little word about cashmereCashmere is a natural fiber produced by cashmere goats and originating from the mountainous regions shared between India, Pakistan and Mongolia. One goat produces only 150 grams of wool per year, which explains the rarity of this exceptional textile. Introduced in Europe at the end of the 18th century, cashmere seduces with its softness and lightness like no other.⸻⸻⸻🧶 Softness, comfort and warmthWhile particularly thin and light, cashmere ideally protects from the cold. The cashmere scarf remains a must-have for winter and allows you to bring a slender touch to all your outfits. Despite this, cashmere remains a noble product that requires special attention in order to keep its softness and immaculate appearance. ⸻⸻⸻📝 Additional information→ Composition: 100% cashmere→ Dimensions: 180 x 65 cm→ Packaging dimensions: 35 x 25 x 4 cm", "We promise to refund your scarf if you are not completely satisfied. Offer valid for up to 30 days from receipt of your product. Customer service available 7 days a week in French."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Accessories", "Scarves & Wraps", "Fashion Scarves"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "11.42 x 8.54 x 1.77 inches; 12.31 Ounces", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "October 23, 2021"}, "average_rating": 5.0, "rating_number": 5, "store": "Generic"}
{"parent_asin": "B00IL15UWI", "title": "Fjallraven Men's Sarek Trekking Shirt", "features": ["60% Polyester/40%Cotton", "Imported", "Button closure", "Hardwearing shirt with regular fit for trekking and multifaceted outdoor life.", "Made from unwaxed G-1000 Original that is pre-washed for a soft feel against the skin.", "The material wicks away moisture and dries fast, giving maximum comfort during sweaty activities.", "Any excess heat can be released through ventilation openings with net fabric under the arms and in the yoke across the shoulders.", "Two chest pockets and an arm pocket, all with buttoned flaps. The sleeve buttons keep rolled-up sleeves in place."], "description": ["Trekking shirt in non-waxed G-1000 Original and pre-washed for maximum comfort. Regular fit with vent mesh openings in the pits and under the yoke at the back work perfectly to keep an active body well ventilated."], "price": 114.95, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Shirts", "Casual Button-Down Shirts"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "15 x 10 x 2 inches; 14.08 Ounces", "Item model number": "F81838", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "February 22, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Fjall Raven (outdoor)"}, "average_rating": 4.7, "rating_number": 112, "store": "Fjallraven"}
