{"parent_asin": "B00HSHIO42", "title": "Skechers Women's Laramie 2 Engineer Boot", "features": ["100% Leather", "Imported", "Manmade sole", "Shaft measures approximately 6\" from arch", "Heel measures approximately 2\"", "Platform measures approximately 1.0\"", "Boot opening measures approximately 10.5\" around", "Lace up casual low mid calf ankle boot with 6 eye lace up and classic logger accents", "Heritage Style", "1 3/4\" Stacked look heel", "Smooth oiled leather or soft nubuck leather upper", "Reinforced stitched seams"], "description": ["The immortal classic returns in the SKECHERS Laramie 2 boot. Smooth oiled or nubuck leather upper in a lace up 6 eye casual logger ankle boot with stitching and overlay accents. A heritage original.", "Skechers is an award-winning global leader in the lifestyle footwear industry that designs, develops, and markets lifestyle footwear that appeals to trend-savvy men, women and children. The company's success stems from it's high quality, diversified, and affordable product line that meets consumers' various lifestyle needs. Since it's inception in 1992, the Skechers diverse product offering has grown from utility style boots to include seven Skechers brands and five uniquely branded fashion lines for men and women."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Boot Shop", "Women", "Fashion", "Motorcycle"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "10 x 15 x 6 inches; 1.5 Pounds", "Item model number": "47808", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "July 24, 2014", "Manufacturer": "Skechers"}, "average_rating": 4.4, "rating_number": 805, "store": "Skechers"}
