{"parent_asin": "B0B5DBLNJF", "title": "WHITIN Men's Casual Easy Slip-On Shoes", "features": ["Canvas", "Rubber sole", "Durable canvas upper with dual elastic goring for easy slip on and off.", "Slip resistant rubber outsole delivers long-lasting durability and adds stability.", "Shock-absorbing midsole designed with lasting arch support for all-day comfort.", "Breathable mesh lining helps keep your foot comfortably dry.", "Padded collar for more comfort while you're in movement."], "description": [], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Shoes", "Loafers & Slip-Ons"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "12.71 x 7.99 x 4.49 inches; 1.74 Pounds", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "June 29, 2022"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 176, "store": "WHITIN"}
{"parent_asin": "B00WMBGZV8", "title": "Franco Sarto Women's Delight Boot", "features": ["100% Leather/Manmade", "Imported", "Synthetic sole", "Shaft measures approximately 5.5\" from arch", "Heel measures approximately 2.5\"", "Boot opening measures approximately 9.75\" around", "Strappy sandal", "Adjustable buckles", "3 3/4 inch heel", "Padded footbed"], "description": ["Strappy caged sandal with adjustable ankle strap. Padded footbed for comfort and perfect fit. Luxe kid suede materials", "More than the name of a footwear brand, Franco Sarto the man is the driving inspiration and passion behind the actual designs. By the age of 14, Sarto was working in a shoe factory where his job was to hand-last shoes with a hammer and nails. It is Sarto's start as a cobbler, and his passion as a designer that makes him a rarity in the business. He designs his shoes both with the sweat and blood of a technician and the grace and beauty of a world-renowned fashion designer. To this day, Sarto hand sketches many of his designs. Franco Sarto understands a woman's undying passion for shoes and is dedicated to keeping that passion alive by crafting beautiful shoes that bring joy to women around the world."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Boot Shop", "Women", "Fashion", "Dress"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "11.1 x 10.4 x 4.4 inches; 14 Ounces", "Item model number": "Delight", "Department": "womens", "Date First Available": "July 14, 2015", "Manufacturer": "Franco Sarto"}, "average_rating": 4.2, "rating_number": 25, "store": "Franco Sarto"}
