{"parent_asin": "B012CBCCZU", "title": "Willis Judd 7mm Titanium Blue Carbon Fiber Ring in Velvet Gift Packaging Black– Size 10", "features": ["PURE TITANIUM with BLACK IP PLATING & 100% HYPOALLERGENIC! Titanium is extremely strong and incredibly light weight you'll hardly know you are wearing it. Titanium is an extremely robust and very low maintenance metal perfect for everyday wear, it will not irritate your skin or cause the allergic reactions that steel and copper can.", "PERFECTLY PACKAGED in the stunning premium quality Willis Judd Packaging. This provides a great place to keep this lovely jewellery safe or make it a fantasic gift to give!", "7mm WIDE - around a ¼ inch - This ring is made with a comfort fit design to ensure it sits nicely on the finger and wont cause any discomfort", "MANY SIZE OPTIONS! We provide this stunning piece of jewellery in many different sizes ensuring you will always have the one that fits you best. Please choose your size from the drop down menu!"], "description": ["Willis Judd 7mm Titanium Blue Carbon Fiber Ring in Velvet Gift Packaging Black", "This elegant Ring features strong titanium with black IP plating , Willis Judd are proud to present this stunning ring.", "Why are these Willis Judd rings so special?", "PURE TITANIUM with BLACK IP PLATING & 100% HYPOALLERGENIC! Titanium is extremely strong and incredibly light weight you'll hardly know you are wearing it. Titanium is an extremely robust and very low maintenance metal perfect for everyday wear.", "7mm WIDE - around a 1/4 inch – This ring is made with a comfort fit design to ensure it sits nicely on the finger and won’t cause any discomfort", "PERFECTLY PACKAGED in the stunning premium quality Willis Judd Packaging. This provides a great place to keep this lovely jewellery safe or make it a fantasic gift to give!", "TRUSTED SELLER – We have been selling jewelry on Amazon for years, view our feedback and buy in confidence", "QUALITY ASSURRRED – Every ring is quality checked by ourselves, we take pride in our product and its presentation to you. What's more, we have a no-quibble, money-back return policy.", "Willis Judd has been selling on Amazon for several years, and is proud to be selling these rings. Our mission is to develop contemporary and stylish jewelry."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Jewelry", "Rings"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "2.7 x 2 x 1.1 inches; 0.32 Ounces", "Item model number": "USR0287sz10", "Department": "Mens", "Date First Available": "July 23, 2015", "Manufacturer": "Willis Judd"}, "average_rating": 4.7, "rating_number": 3, "store": "Willis Judd"}
{"parent_asin": "B0056E6IHY", "title": "ASICS Women's GEL-Ipera Cross-training Shoe", "features": ["100% Synthetic and mesh", "Rubber sole", "California slip lasting with the upper stitched around a canvas or EVA board and directly attached to the midsole", "Rearfoot GEL cushioning system", "Removable sockliner"], "description": ["Don't let the wild colors scare you away, the ASICS® GEL-Ipera™ can back it up with its stability and comfort; it's ready to take on any sport you want.", "Don't let the wild colors scare you away, the ASICS® GEL-Ipera™ can back it up with its stability and comfort; it's ready to take on any sport you want.", "Uppers made from lightweight monofilament mesh materials.", "Uppers made from lightweight monofilament mesh materials.", "Removable sockliner can be removed to accommodate a medical orthotic.", "Removable sockliner can be removed to accommodate a medical orthotic.", "Trusstic System® exists as a molded component which reduces the weight of the sole unit while retaining the structural integrity of the shoe.", "Trusstic System® exists as a molded component which reduces the weight of the sole unit while retaining the structural integrity of the shoe.", "ASICS® Rearfoot GEL® Cushioning System attenuates shock during impact the phase and allows for a smooth transition to midstance.", "ASICS® Rearfoot GEL® Cushioning System attenuates shock during impact the phase and allows for a smooth transition to midstance.", "Solid rubber outsole provides enhanced durability and traction.", "Solid rubber outsole provides enhanced durability and traction.", "Measurements: Weight: 10 oz", "Measurements:", "Weight: 10 oz", "Weight: 10 oz", "Product measurements were taken using size 8.5, width B - Medium. Please note that measurements may vary by size.", "Product measurements were taken using size 8.5, width B - Medium. Please note that measurements may vary by size.", "In 1949, Mr. Kihachiro Onitsuka began his athletic footwear company (Onitsuka Co., Ltd.) by manufacturing basketball shoes out of his living room in Kobe, Japan. He chose the name ASICS for his company in 1977, based on a famous Latin phrase \"Anima Sana In Corpore Sano,\" which, when translated, expresses the ancient ideal of \"A Sound Mind in a Sound Body.\" Taking the acronym of this phrase, ASICS was founded on the belief that the best way to create a healthy and happy lifestyle is to promote total health and fitness. Today, ASICS offers a full line of performance-driven athletic shoes and technical active sports apparel and accessories dedicated to bringing harmony to the body and soul."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Athletic", "Fitness & Cross-Training"], "details": {"Product Dimensions": "11 x 4 x 7 inches; 12 Ounces", "Item model number": "Gel Ipera-W", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "January 19, 2012", "Manufacturer": "ASICS"}, "average_rating": 4.0, "rating_number": 30, "store": "ASICS"}
