{"parent_asin": "B07H8XP213", "title": "Skechers Women's Parallel-Three Strap Buckle Slingback Wedge Sandal", "features": ["100% Leather", "Imported", "Synthetic sole", "Platform measures approximately 1 inches inches inches", "Memory Foam full length cushioned comfort footbed", "Soft suede upper", "Wedge heeled casual heel sling fashion sandal design"], "description": ["Three strap buckle slingback wedge sandal with memory foam cushioned footbed", "Skechers is an award-winning global leader in the lifestyle footwear industry that designs, develops, and markets lifestyle footwear that appeals to trend-savvy men, women and children. The company's success stems from it's high quality, diversified, and affordable product line that meets consumers' various lifestyle needs. Since it's inception in 1992, the Skechers diverse product offering has grown from utility style boots to include seven Skechers brands and five uniquely branded fashion lines for men and women."], "price": null, "categories": ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Sandals", "Platforms & Wedges"], "details": {"Package Dimensions": "12.5 x 9.6 x 4.9 inches; 9 Ounces", "Item model number": "41101", "Department": "Womens", "Date First Available": "March 14, 2019", "Manufacturer": "Skechers"}, "average_rating": 4.3, "rating_number": 482, "store": "Skechers"}
